<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MALU - Mbalanhu Bible Translation</book>
  <para style="toc1">Onghundana Oiwa nganhyi ya shangwa kuMalukusa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malukusa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Malukusa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Onghundana Oiwa nganhyi ya shangwa ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malukusa</para>
  <para style="imt">EFALOMO</para>
  <para style="im">Efalomo LyEvaageli kombiga yaYesus, lya shangwa kuMalukusa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Embo lyaMalukusa lyEvaageli kombiga yaYesus, olyo limwe lyomomambo yane yEtestamendi Epe, ndi ali popi mo olweendonghalamwenyo lwaYesus Kilistus. Kehe limwe lyomuyo oha li ifanwa “Evaangeli” nhyi a shi ti “Onghundana Oiwa.” Omambo nga, oya li ya shangwa konima yeso lyaYesus kuMateusa, kuMalukusa, kuLukasa nokuYohanesa. Embo lyaMalukusa olyo ehupi leela kumakwao yane. Olya itaelwa kutya olyo lya shangwa tango kumakwao ayehe, pokati keevula omilongo hamano nanhano siyo eevula omilongo heyali, konima yevalo lyaKilistus. Aakonaakoni yomishangwa oyendji oya itaela kutya embo ndi olya li lya shangelwa muLooma, nelalakano lyokutwa omukumo aanhu yomuLooma mba ya itaela muKilistus.</para>
  <para style="ip">Malukusa ngu a shiikwa nevina Yohanesa Malukusa, okwa li kaume komutumwa waKalunga Paulusa naBarnabas ndele oukwatya waye owa ka shinduka nhyi a fiye po olweendo lwao lwetumo. (Oilonga yAatumwa 13:13). Konima Malukusa okwa ya natango molweendo naBarnabas. (Oilonga yAatumwa 15:37-39). Malukusa okwa li a vibululwa kutya okwa li kaume kopofingo kaPeetulusa. (1 Peetulusa 5:13). Nande nee Malukusa ka li a mona Yesus nhyi e li momwenyo, aakonaakoni yomishangwa oya li ya itaela kutya Malukusa okwa li a shanga oshindji okuza moumbagihokololo waPeetulusa, nanhyi osho ekanghameno lyOnghundana Oiwa ndji ya shangwa Malukusa. Membo lyOinghundana Oiwa nganhyi ya shangwa kuMalukusa, okwa shanga a taalela unene nghee u na okuninga omulanduli waYesus nokombiga yomalongo yaYesus kombinga yefimbo lyehulilo lyouyuni.</para>
  <para style="iot">Oshikalimo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Malukusa ta hokolola efalomo lyembo mOnhopolwa 1:1-13.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Malukusa ta popi mo oilonga ayihe yaYesus efimbo ndi Yesus a li muGalilea mOnhopolwa 1:14—8:21.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ta landulifako olweendo lwaYesus oku ya kuJerusalem 8:22—10:52.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Malukusa ta mana nokushanga kombiga yefimbo lyaYesus nhyi a li muJerusalem, mwa kwatelwa eso neumuko lyaye 11:1—16:8.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Euvifo lyaYohanesa Omushashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateusa3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lukasa3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohanesa1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Mbu owo omukalo nghee Onghundana Oiwa tai popi Yesus Kilistus Omona waKalunga ya tameka. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Ngahnyi sha shangwa kuYesaya omuhunganeki waKalunga ta ti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Kalunga okwa ti, ‘Onghee hano andi tumu omutumwa wange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">e mu tetekele, opo e mu opalekele ondjila.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Ewi lyanakwiingiva mombuwa ali ti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Longekivileni Omwene ondjila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">nye mu ukililife omalila yaye.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yohanesa Omushashi okwa ya mombuwa, ndele ta uvifa kutya aanhu naa efe okulonga oulunde, ndee taa shashwa, opo Kalunga a vime po eendjo vao. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Aanhu oyendji ya za moitopolwa ayihe yaYudea, noko shilando Yelusalema oya ya kuYohanesa yeke mu pwaikina. Oya hokolola mo eendjo vao, ndele taa shashwa kuYohanesa, momulonga waYoldan. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohanesa okwa li a zala onguwo yomafufu yoshinamwenyo hashiifanwa ongamelo, nomwiya woshipa moshiya, ndele oikulya yaye oya li omapahu nomaavi yeenyiki. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Okwa li ta uvifa ta ti, “Ngu te ya konima yange, omunaenghono e vule nge, naame inandi wana okupetama ndi mangulule eemwiya veenghaku vaye. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ame onde mu shasha nomeya, ndele ye oteke mu shasha nOmhepo Ondjapuki.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eshasho nemakelo lyaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mateusa3:13—4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Lukasa3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Konima yomasiku, Yesus okwa za kuNasaleta moshitopolwa shaGalilea, nokwa shashwa kuYohanesa momulonga waYoldan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Nanhyi Yesus ali ta zi momeya, okwa mona eulu lya yeuluka, nOmhepo Ondjapuki oya wila kombada yaye molupe lwonghuti. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Nomeulu omwa za ewi lya ti, “Ooye Omona wange Omuholike, onde ku panda. <verse eid="MRK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Viyaviya Omhepo oye mu fala mombuwa, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />mu a kala omasiku omilongo ne, ta makelwa kuSatana. Omwa li mu na noilikama ndele aayengeli yaKalunga oye ya, ndee taye mu kwafele.”<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta ifana aakwati yeehi yane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mateusa4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Lukasa4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Konima nhyi Yohanesa a ivililwa movologo, Yesus okwa ya kuGalilea, ndele ta uvifa onghundana oiwa ya za kuKalunga <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />ta ti, “Efimbo olya fika, Ouhamba waKalunga owe ya popepi, itevululeni nye mwiitaele onghundana oiwa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Nhyi Yesus ali ta ende komukunghulo wefuta lyaGalilea, okwa mona aamwainafana, Simoni naAndiliasa, taa umbile onhete mefuta, shaanhyi oya li aakwati yeehi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Landuleni nge, andi mu ningi aakwati yaanhu” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Meendelelo oya efa eenhete vao, ndele taye mu landula.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Nhyi a ya kokule kashona, okwa mona Yakopo naYohanesa oyanamati yaSebedeus, ya li mowato, taa longekiva eenhete vao. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Yesus okwe ya ifana meendelelo ye mu landule. Oya fiya mo he Sebedeus mowato pamwe naalumenhu yoilonga, ndele taa landula Yesus.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omulumenhu e na omhepo ya kaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Lukasa4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesus naalongwa yaye oye ya moshilando shaKapelenaum, ndele mEsiku Lyevululuko, Yesus okwa ya mehala mu Aayuda haa ongala opo ya yalikane, hali ifanwa Oshinagoga, kokutya Oshinyanga, ndele ta tameke okulonga. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Aanhu oya li ya kumwa kelongo lyaye, shaanhyi okwa li ta longo neenghono noufemba, kaishi nganhyi aalongimhango.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Pefimbo mho, mOshinagoga omwe ya omulumenhu e na omhepo ya kaka noya ingiva mopale, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />ya ti, “Yesus Omunasaleta, owe tu halela shi? Owe ya u tu hanaune po? Ondi ku shi kutya, ooye Omuyapuki waKalunga!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesus okwa ngada omhepo ya kaka, a ti, “Mwena filu, ndele to zi mo muye!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Omhepo ya kaka oye mu mbugaambuga, yo tai ingiva mopale, ndele tai zi mo muye. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Aanhu ayehe oya li ya kumwa, ndele taa tameke okupulafana taa ti, “Oshishi nhyi? Hano ndi elongo opo lye ya ko? Omulumenhu ngu oku na eenghono nepangelo, ta lombwele eemhepo va kaka, ndele avi vulika kuye!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Meendelelo, oshiningwanima nhyi, kombiga yaYesus osha tandaela momikunda avihe vomuGalilea.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva aanhu oyendji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateusa8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Lukasa4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Viyaviya Yesus naalongwa yaye nhyi ya za mo moshinagoga, oya ya naYakopo naYohanesa molyao ya Simoni naAndiliasa. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Yinamweno yaSimoni okwa li e li mombete youyehame taaluka olwiivi, ndele Yesus nhyi a fika, aanhu oye mu popya kuye. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yesus okwe ya kuye, temu kwata monyala, e mu fikameke, nolwiivi olwa zamo muye, ndele ta tameke oku ya yakula.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Etango nhyi lya ningina, aanhu oya eta aanauvu ayehe, namba ya kwatwa keemhepo va kaka kuYesus. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Aanhu ayehe yomoshilando oya ongala posheelo sheumbo. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesus okwa yeluva aanhu oyendji komauvu ya yooloka, ndele ta te mo eemhepo va kaka ovidji, no ina pitika nande eemhepo va kaka vi popye sha, shaanhyi ovi mu shii.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta uvifa muGalilea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Lukasa4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Ongula onene mhanga eluwa inali tenda, Yesus okwa penduka, ndee ta zi mo meumbo. Okwa za mo moshilando a ya kehala lye ikalela, ndee ta yalikana. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni namba a li nayo oya ya, yaka konga Yesus. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Nhyi yemu mona, oya ti, “Aanhu ayehe otae ku kongo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Ituyeni momikunda vopoushiinda, opo nayo ndi ke ya uvifile, shaanhyi osho nda endela.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Onghee hano, okwa enda muGalilea ashihe, ta uvifa mOinagoga yao, ndele ta te mo eemhepo va kaka.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omunashilundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateusa8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Lukasa5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Omunashilundu okwe ya kuYesus, ta tu eengolo te mu indile ta ti, “Nge oweshi hala, oto vulu okuyeleka nge.” <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesus okwe mu uvila onghenda, nokwa nana eke lyaye, ndele te mu kwata ta ti, “Onda hala, yela!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Viyaviya oshilundu osha za mo momulumenhu ngo, nokwa yela. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yesus okwe mu londova neenghono mhanga inemu lekela, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />ta ti, “Pwaikina! Ino shi popya nande okomunhu. Ndele inda ashike u ke iyulike komuyambi, e ku konaakone, opo shi ninge oumbagi kaanhu kutya owa eluvwa, oye uka yandje efikiloyambo lyeyeluko lyoye ndi lya ufwa kuMoses.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ndele omunhu ngu nhyi a ya pondje, okwa tameka ta hokolola oshiningwanima ashihe akuhe. Onghee Yesus ina vula ali okweenda moilando monhaneho yaanhu, ndele okwa kala komahala nghu kaku na aanhu. Ndele nande ongaanhyo aanhu keembiga neembiga oye ya kuye.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omusilombada</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateusa9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Lukasa5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Nhyi pwa pita omasiku omashona, Yesus okwa ya kuKapelenaum, naanhu oya uva kutya opo e li peumbo. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Aanhu oyendji oya li ya ongala, no kamwa li mu na ehala meumbo noposheelo. Yesus okwa li te ya uvifile eehapu. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Ongudu yaanhu oya eta omusilombada kuYesus, a hindwa kaalumenhu yane. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Molwoundji waanhu, oya nyengwa oku mu fikifa puYesus. Onghee oya ulula ombululu kombada yonduda, ya ukilila mha puna Yesus, ndele taa kulukifa omusilombada, a nangala poshiinda shaye. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Nhyi Yesus a mona eitaelo lyao, okwa lombwela omusilombada, “Mumwange, eendjo voye ova vimwa po.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Aalongimhango yamwe mba ya li mo omutumba, oya vilaavila momitima vao, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Omolwashi ta popi ngaanhyi? Ota tuku Kalunga! Olye ta vulu okuvima po eendjo, keshi ike Kalunga?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Viyaviya Yesus okwa vibulula momhepo yaye, kutya osho taa vilaavila ngaanhyo, ndele ta ti kuyo, “Omolwashi mu na omavilaavilo ya fa mho momitima veni? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Nhyi oshipu shipi? Okulombwela omusilombada, ‘Eendjo voye ova vimwa po,’ nenge okulombwela omusilombada, ‘Fikama, kufa oshiinda shoye ndele to ende’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Andi mu kwashilipaleke mu kale mu shi shii kutya Omona wOmunhu oku na eenghono nepangelo okuvima po eendjo kombada yevu.” Opo nee Yesus okwa ti komusilombada, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Andi ku lombwele, fikama, kufa oshiinda shoye, ndele toyi kolyoye.”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Omulumenhu okwa fikama, ndele ta kufa po oshiinda shaye, ndee ta yi, monhaneho yaayehe. Aanhu ayehe oya li ya kumwa noya hambelela Kalunga ya ti, “Inatu mona nande onale oshiima sha fa mha!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta ifana Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateusa9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Lukasa5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesus okwa shuna komukunghulo wefuta lyaGalilea. Aanhu oyendji oye ya kuye, ndee ta tameke oku ya longa. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Mokweenda kwaye okuya komeho, okwa mona omufendelifi Levi yaAlfeusa e li omutumba ponduda yomafutilo, ndee Yesus ta ti kuye, “Landula nge.” Levi okwa fikama, ndee te mu landula.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Ongulohi yesiku ndyo, Yesus okwa li omutumba ta li oulalelo meumbo lyaLevi, aafendelifi naalunde oyendji oya lila pamwe naye nonaalongwa yaye, molwanhyi oyendji yomuyo oya li ye mu landula. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Ndele yamwe yomaalongimhango mba ya li Aafalisai nhyi ya mona Yesus ta lile pamwe naalunde nonaafendelifi oya pula aalongwa yaye ya ti, “Omolwashi Yesus ta lile pamwe naafendelifi naalunde?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Nhyi Yesus eshi uva, okwa ti kuyo, “Mba ye na oundjolowele inaa pumbwa omuyeluvi, ndele aanauvu ayeke. Ame inandi ya okwiifana aayuuki, ndele aalunde.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elongo kombiga yo kwiivilika oikulya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateusa9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Lukasa5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Efimbo limwe, aalongwa yaYohanesa nAafalisai oya li haye ivilike okulya. Aanhu yamwe oye ya kuYesus, ndele taye mu pula, “Omolwashi aalongwa yaYohanesa naalongwa yAafalisai haye ivilike okulya, ndele aalongwa yoye ihaye ivilike okulya?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Oinghumbi otai vulu ngeepi okwiivilika okulya moshitufihango? Ahawe, ihai vulu! Mhanga omuhomboli e li mokati kao, ihaa vulu okwiivilika okulya. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Omasiku otaye ya, mha omuhomboli taye mu kufwa, opo nee taye ke ivilika okulya.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Kaku na ngu ta andeke oshaando oshipe koshikutu oshikulu, nge e shi ninga, oshaando oshipe ashi taula oshikutu, ndele nombululu tai ningi onene yi vulife yonale. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Kaku na ngu ta zili omaviinyu omape momhunda yoshipa onghulu, shaanhyi omaviinyu mokupya, otaa taula omhunda yoshipa, nomaviinyu nomhunda ayihe otai hepa, ndele omaviinyu omape otaa zilwa momhunda yoshipa omhe.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elongo kombiga yEsiku Lyevululuko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-18">Mateusa12:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Lukasa6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Esiku limwe Lyevululuko lyAayuda hali ifanwa Esabati, Yesus okwa li ta ende mokati komapya yoilya. Mhanga taa ende, aalongwa oya tameke okuteya omitwe voilya. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Aafalisai oya ti kuYesus, “Tala, oshi li omhinge nomhango, okuninga nhyi ashi ningwa kaalongwa yoye mesiku lyEsabati?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Ina mu lesha mboli, nhyi David naanhu mba ya li naye ya ningile nhyi ya li ya sa ondjala? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />David okwa li a ya meumbo lyaKalunga pefimbo lyomuyambi omukulunhu Abiatal, ndele ta li omboloto, ndji inai pitikwa okuliwa kumba kaye shi aayambi pamhango yetu, ndee ta pe namba a li nayo.<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Esiku lyEsabati olya shitilwa ouwa womunhu, ndele omunhu haye a shitilwa esiku lyEsabati, <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />onghee hano Omona wOmunhu oye Omwene wEsabati.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omulumenhu e na onyala ya lemana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateusa12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Lukasa6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Nhyi pwa pita omasiku omashona, Yesus okwa shuna kehala nghu Aayuda haa ongalele hali ifanwa Oshinagoga. Mehala mo omwa li mu na omulumenhu e na onyala ya lemana. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Aanhu yamwe mba ya li mo, oya li taa tala nge Yesus ote mu eluva mesiku lyEsabati, opo ya vule oku mu lundila, kutya ota longo nhyi inashi pitikwa okuningwa mEsabati. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesus okwa lombwela omulumenhu ngu e na onyala ya lemana a ti, “Ila u fikame komeho yaayehe.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Yesus okwe ya pula a ti, “Oshishi sha pitikwa okuningwa pamhango mesiku lyEsabati? Okulonga ouwa nenge okulonga ouyi? Okuhupifa omwenyo nenge okuvipaa?” Ndele inaa yamukula sha.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesus okwe ya tala ayehe noshipala sha handuka, a nyika oluhovi omolwoukukutu womitima vao. Okwa lombwela omulumenhu ngo ta ti, “Ukililifa oshikaha shoye.” Omulumenhu okwe shi ukililifa, noshikaha shaye osha eluka. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Meendelelo, Aafalisai oya za mo moshinagoga, ya ka ongala naalanduli yaHelodesa, ndee taa kundafana omhangela opo ya vipae Yesus.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ongudu onene yaanhu komunghulo wefuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesus naalongwa yaye oya ya kefuta lyaGalilea, nongudu onene yaanhu oye mu landula, ya za kuGalilea kuYudea, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />kuYelusalema, kuzaIdumea, kuza kouzilo womulonga waYoldan nokoshilando shaTilus naSidon. Aanhu ayehe mba oye ya kuYesus, molwanhyi ya uva ayihe mbi a ninga. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Molwoundji waanhu, Yesus okwa lombwela aalongwa yaye ye mu longekivile okawato, opo aanhu inaye mu finaneka. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Yesus okwa eluva aanhu oyendji, onghee mba ya li ye na omauvu, oya li taa kondjifa okwiifininika nelalakano ye mu kume. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Na kehe mha eemhepo va kaka avi mu mono, ohavi wile pohi koshipala shaye, ndele avi ingiva avi ti, “Ooye Omona waKalunga!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ndele nee, Yesus okwa lombwela eemhepo va kaka opo ina vi mu popya kutya oye lye.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta hoolola aatumwa yaye omulongo nayaali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateusa10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Lukasa6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yesus okwa londa kondudu, ndee ta ifana aalumenhu mba ye mwene a hala, naalumenhu oye ya kuye. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Okwa hoolola mo omulongo nayaali, ndee teya luku “Aayapostoli” kokutya Aatumwa. Okwe ya hoolola, opo ya kale pamwe naye, yaka uvife, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />yo ya kale ye na eenghono nepangelo, lyokuta mo eemhepo va kaka.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Aatumwa omulongo nayaali, mba a hoolola, omavina yao oyo, oSimoni ngu Yesus e mu luka Peetulusa, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />naYakopo omonamati waSebedeus namumwaina Yohanesa, mba Yesus e ya luka Boanerges, nhyi ashi ti, “Oyana yomundudumo,” <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />naAndiliasa, naFilippus, naBartolomeus, naMateusa, naTomas, naYakopo yaAlfeusa, naTaddeus, naSimoni ependa, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />naYudas Iskalioto, ngu aka kengelela Yesus.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus naBelsebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mateusa12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Lukasa11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Yesus okwa ya keumbo, naanhu oyendji oya ongala, mha Yesus naalongwa yaye inaa mona efimbo lyokulya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Nhyi aakwanezimo yaye ye shi uva, oya ya ko, yeke mu kwata, shaanhyi aanhu oya li taa ti, “Otayi eemhwengu!”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Aalongimhango mba ya za kuYelusalema oya ti, “Okuna Belsebul! Omukulunhu weemhepo va kaka ngu oye temu pe eenghono voku vi ta mo.” <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yesus okwe ya ifana, ndee te ya lombwele momayele ta ti, “Satana ota vulu ngeepi okuta mo Satana? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Nge aanhu yomouhamba umwe otaye itopola pokati, ndee taye ilwifa, nena ouhamba mbo ihau kala po. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Osho nghaa naanhu yeumbo limwe, nge otaye itopola pokati, ndee taye ilwifa, eumbo ndyo iha li kala po. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Na Satana nge ote itopola, ndee te ikondjifa, iha vulu okukala po, ota hulu po.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Kaku na ngu ta vulu okuya meumbo lyomunanghono, ndele ta kufa mo omaliko yaye, okuninga shapo ta manga tango omunaenghono, opo a vule okukufamo omaliko yaye.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Oshili, andi mu lombwele, aanhu otaa viminwa po eendjo nomatukano yao ayehe nga taa popi ye li omhinge naKalunga. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Ndele kehe ngu ta sheke Omhepo Ondjapuki, iha viminwa po, ota kala ena eendjo vaaluhe.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesus okwa popya nhyi, molwanhyi aanhu yamwe oya li taa ti, “Okuniwe omhepo ya kaka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yina naamwaina yaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateusa12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Lukasa8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Yina naamwaina yaYesus oye ya po. Oya kala ofika kondje yeumbo, ndee taa tumu mo etumwalaka, kulombwelwe Yesus kutya otaye mu pula. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Ongudu yaanhu oya li omutumba ya ngudumanena Yesus, noye mu lombwela taa ti, “Tala, nyoko naamwanyoko aalumenhu naakiinhu oye li pondje taye ku pula.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Meme olye naamwameme aalumenhu oolye?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Okwa tala mba ye li omutumba puye, ndee ta ti, “Taleni, meme naamwameme oyo mba! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Kehe ngu ta longo ehalo lyaKalunga, oye mumwameme omulumenhu, namumwameme omukiinhu nameme.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Eele lyomukuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateusa13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Lukasa8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Natango Yesus okwa tameka okulonga aanhu pomunghulo wefuta lyaGalilea. Ongudu onene yaanhu oya li ye mu ongalela, onghee okwa ya mokawato, ndele ta kala omutumba oya li momeya nongudu yaanhu ayihe oya li komutunda wefuta. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Okwe ya longa oinima oyindji momaele. Mokulonga kwaye okwa ti kuyo,<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Pwaikineni! Okwa li ku na omukuni, ngu a ya a ka kuna eembuto vaye. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Mokukuna kwaye, okwa li ta kunu ta kupula. Eembuto vimwe ova wila mondjila, neevila ove ya, ndele avi vi shomona po. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Vimwe ova wila mevu li na omamanya omendji, kapwa li evu lya wana neembuto ova mena meendelelo, molwanhyi evu kalya li eleka. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ontenya nhyi wa twa, owa fika po oimeno mbi ya li oishona, shaanhyi kaya li yi na omivi va ya mopale, noimeno oya sa po. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Eembuto vimwe ova wila meehongo, neehongo ova koka, ndele avi finaneke oimeno, ndele oimeno inayi vula okutula ko nande omuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Ndele eembuto vimwe ova wila mevu oliwa. Ova mena, avi koko, ndee avi vala, vimwe olwomilongo nhatu, vimwe olwomilongo hamano navimwe olwefele.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Yesus okwa manifa ta ti, “Ngu e na omakutsi yokupwaikina, na uve ko nhyi andi ti!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elalakano lyomaele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateusa13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Lukasa8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Mhanga Yesus a li e ikalela, yamwe yomumba ya li ye mu uva, oye ya kuye pamwe naalongwa omulongo nayaali. Oye mu indila opo e ya fatululile omayele. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Nye omwa pewa okuuva ko oiholekwa yOuhamba waKalunga, mhanga aanhu yamwe, oinima ayihe otaye yi uvu pamayele, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />opo nee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">ohaa tala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">ndele kaye wete ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">ohaa pwaikine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">ndele kaye uvite ko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">ngeno okwa li haye shi ningi, ngeno otaa yalukile kuKalunga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">ndele teya viminepo.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta fatulula eele lyomukuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateusa13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lukasa8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Ndele Yesus okwe ya pula a ti, “Nge kamu uvite ko eyele ndi, otamu vulu ngeepi okuuva ko omayele makwawo? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Omukuni okwa kuna ohapu yaKalunga. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Aanhu yamwe oya fa evu lyomondjila, mu mwa wila eembuto, ndele viyaviya konima nhyi ya uva ohapu, Satana okwe ya, ndele teya kufa ohapu ndji ya kunwa muyo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Aanhu yamwe oya fa evu lyomamanya, ndi kali na evu lya wana, taa uvu eehapu, ndele ta ye vi tambula ko nehafo, <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />ndele iha vi ningine mo muyo vi kale nomivi. Otaye vi viinine ike pokafimbo, ndele shaa pwe ya ouviyu nenge omahepeko, eehapu otaye vi efa meendelelo. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Aanhu yamwe oya fa evu li na eehongo, mba oyo mba haa uvu eehapu, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ndele oshiho shouyuni mbu nohole yomaliko, nomauhalu ya yooloka, otaa finaneke eehapu, ndele iha vi imike ali oiyimati. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Ndele aanhu yamwe oya fa evu oliwa. Mba oyo mba taa uvu eehapu, ndele taye vi tambula ko, ndele taa yimike oiyimati lwomilongo nhatu, nolwomilongo hamano nolwefele.<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olamba kohi yoshimbale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Lukasa8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesus okwe ya pula ta ti; “Oku na nghaa ngu ta tema olamba, ndele te yi tula kohi yoshimbale nenge kohi yombete? Ndi shi oku na oku yi tula koshikwatelwalamba? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Omolwanhyi kaku na nhyi sha holekwa, ihashi ke ya pouyelele, ko kaku na nhyi sha siikilwa ihashi ka suukulwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Ngu ena omakutsi yokupwaikina, na uve ko nhyi andi ti!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesus okwe ya lombwela natango a ti, “Pwaikineni nawa kunhyi amu uvu! Eemhango vi tamu yelekifa navo yakweni, nanye ovo nghaa Kalunga te ke mu yelekifa navo, mwa wevelwako nokuli. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Oshonhyi ngu ena, oye ta ka pewa oshindji, ndele ngu ke na sha, nokashona ngha a li e na, oteke ka kufwa.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eele lyokukoka kwombuto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesus okwa twikila ko ta ti, “Ouhamba waKalunga owa fa omunhu a kuna eembuto mevu. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Omutenya nenge ousiku, a kofa nenge a penduka, eembuto a vi mene ndele a vi koko, ndele ke shii kutya osha ningwa ngeepi. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Evu olyo lyene tali kokifa oimeno, ndele ta li etififa oiyimati. Tango efina, ta li landulwa komutwe, neemuma avi kolo komutwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Ngeege eemuma va kukuta, omuteyi ota kufa oshiteyifo a teye, shaanhyi eteyo olya fika.<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eele lyomuma onhiki lela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mateusa13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Lukasa13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesus okwa pula a ti, “Ouhamba waKalunga atu ti owa fa shike? Eele lipi tu na oku longifa opo tuu fatulule?” <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Owa fa omunhu ta kufa omuma oshona lela, hayi ifanwa omuma yomastada, ndele te yi kunu mevu. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Konima nhyi ya kunwa, ohai koko yi vule oimeno ayihe mepya. Ohai ningi oitayi oinene, neevila vokeulu ohavi tungile oihavila momuzile wawo.<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesus okwa uvifila aanhu eehapu pamayele makwawo omendji ya fa nga, pandodo yeuveko lya wo. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Ayihe okwei popya momayele, ndele nhyi a li naalongwa yaye, okwe ya fatululila oinima ayihe.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta kanghameke oshikungulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateusa8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Lukasa8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Ongulohi yesiku ndyo, Yesus okwa ti kaalongwa yaye, “Tu taulukeni tuyeni kombiga onghwawo yefuta.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Oya fiipo ongudu yaanhu, ndele aalongwa oya londa mokawato mu Yesus a li omutumba, ndele taa yi pamwe naye. Mha ya li, opwa li ouwato umwe ali. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Okwa za omhepo onene tayi pepe kombada yomeya, nomakufikufi oya li taye ivege mokawato, nokawato hanga ka uva omeya. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesus okwa li a nangala kosindo yokawato a kofa, nomutwe waye wu li koshiwilo. Aalongwa oye mu pendula, ndele taa ti, “Mulongi, mboli ku na ko nasha nanhyi tu li po kusa?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesus okwa penduka, ndele ta ngada omhepo a ti, “Mwena!” Ta lombwele omakufikufi a ti, “Kanghama!” Omhepo oya mwena, nomakufikufi oya lootela. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yesus okwa ti kaalongwa yaye, “Oshishi hano mwa tila? Kamu na natango eitaelo nani?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Aalongwa oya li ya haluka, yo ya tila neenghono, ndele oya pulafana taa ti, “Omulumenhu ngu oye olye naana? Nomhepo nomakufikufi tayi vulika kuye!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omulumenhu e na eemhepo va kaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateusa8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Lukasa8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesus naalongwa yaye oya fika komunghulo wefuta lyaGalilea, koshilongo shaGerasa. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yesus nhyi a za mo mokawato, okwa shakenekwa komulumenhu e niwe keemhepo va kaka ta zi momaendo. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Omulumenhu okwa kala meembila vi va li va panda momamanya, ndele kakwa li kuna nande omunhu ta vulu oku mu manga nande onomalyenge shaanhyi okwa li e na eenghono. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Olundji okwa li ha mangwa nomalyenge noiketanga keenyala nokeemhavi, ndele kehe efimbo omalyenge noiketanga ohe yi tokaula mo. Okwa li ena eenghono, no kakwa li nande omunhu ta vu lu oku mu mweneka. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Omutenya nousiku okwa kala aluhe momaendo nomeendudu, ta ingiva mopale ye te itete nomamanya.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Omulumenhu okwa monena Yesus kokule nokwa tondoka, ndele ta tu eengolo koshipala shaye. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Okwa ingiva mopale ta ti, “Yesus, Omonamati waKalunga wokombadambada! Owa halela nge shike? Andi ku indile koshipala shaKalunga, ino hepeka nge!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Omhepo ya kaka oya popya ayihe mbi, molwanhyi Yesus okwa popya tango petameko kutya, “Mhepo ya kaka, za mo momulumenhu ngu!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yesus okwe mu pula, “Evina lyoye olye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Omhepo ya kaka oya yamukula ya ti, “Aame Ongudu, shaanhyi otu li oyendji.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Omhepo ya kaka oya twikila noku indila Yesus neenghono, opo ina ta mo eemhepo va kaka mehala ndyo.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Opwa li pu na oshuunda oshinene shoingulu tayi li popepi neendudu. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Eemhepo va kaka ova indila Yesus avi ti, “Tu tumina moingulu, oye totu pitike tu kale muyo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesus okwe vi pitike, neemhepo va kaka ova za mo momulumenhu ndele avi yi moingulu. Oshuunda ashihe shoingulu yi fike pomayovi yaali, osha nhuka okuza komutunda omuleka, ndele tashi iyumbile mefuta, ndele tashi sile mo.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Aasita yoingulu oya matuka, ndele taa yi momikunda nomoshilando, ndele taa ka hokolola nhyi sha ningwa po. Aanhu oya ya, opo ya ka tale nhyi sha ningwa ko. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Oye ya kuYesus, ndele oya mona omulumenhu ngu a li a kwatwa kongudu onene yeemhepo va kaka, e li omutumba, a zala nawa ye ena eendunge, naayehe oya li ya tila. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Aanhu mba ye shi mona, oya hokolola nhyi sha ningilwa omulumenhu ngu a li a kwatwa keemhepo va kaka, nanhyi sha ningilwa oingulu.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Aanhu yomoshitopolwa nhyi, oya indila Yesus a ze mo mehala lyao. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Mhanga Yesus ta londo mokawato, omulumenhu ngu a li a kwatwa keemhepo va kaka, okwa indila Yesus kutya okwa hala okuya naye.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yesus ine mu pitika, ndele okwe mu lombwela a ti, “Inda keumbo kuyakweni, u ke ya ulikile nhyi Omwene e ku ningila nanhyi eku sila onghenda.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Omulumenhu okwa ya, nokweenda mOilando Omulongo, ta hokololele aanhu nhyi Yesus e mu ningila, ndele aanhu ayehe nhyi yeshi uva, oya li yakumwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta umuva okamonakavona kaJailus, ndele ta eluva omukiinhu umwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateusa9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Lukasa8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Nhyi Yesus a shuna kombiga nghu a zilila nokawato, aanhu oyendji oye mu ongalela nhyi a li pomunghulo wefuta. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Okwa za umwe womaawiliki yOsinagoga, evina lyaye oJailus. Nhyi a mona Yesus okwa wila pohi peemhavi vaYesus, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />ndele okwe mu indila neenghono ta ti, “Okamwangekavona otaka aluka unene, ila, uka tenheke eke lyoye, opo uka hupife, ko ka kale ke na omwenyo.<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yesus okwa ya pamwe naJairus. Aanhu oyendji oye mu landula, ndele oye mu fininika.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Okwa li ku na omukiinhu e na ouvu wetiko lyohonde eevula omulongo nambali, <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />okwa li a mona oihuna neenghono mokuya keendudu ovidji, noku vi futa ashihe nhyi a li e na, ndele ina kala nawa, ouvu owa ya ike komeho neenghono. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Omukiinhu ngu, nhyi a uva kombinga ya Yesus, okwe ifiinika mokati kaanhu a ye kuYesus, e mu zilila konima, ndele ta kumu onguwo yaye, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />shaanhyi okwa vilaavila kutya, “Shamha nda kumu onguwo yaYesus, andi yeluka.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Viyaviya, etiko lyohonde olya mwena, nokwa uvu molutu lwaye kutya okwa yeluka. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Pokafimbo mho, Yesus okwa uvu eenghono va za mo muye, onghee okwa tala konima yaye mongudu yaanhu, ndele ta pula, “Olye a kuma onguwo yange?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Aalongwa yaye oya yamukula ya ti, “Ou wete kutya aanhu oye ku fiinika, ndele oto pula ali kutya, “Olye a kuma nge?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ndele Yesus okwa kala nokukeyauka, opo a mone ngu eshi ninga. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Omukiinhu nhyi a vibulula nhyi a ningilwa, okwe ya, ndele ta tu eengolo koshipala shaYesus, a tila ye ta kakama, ndele te mu lombwele oshili ashihe. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Mukiinhu, eitaelo lyoye olye ku yeluva. Inda nombili, owa manguluka kouviyu woye.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Mhanga Yesus a li ta popi, opwe ya aanhu ya tumwa ya za kolya Jairus, omuwiliki wOshinagoga taa ti, “Okamwoyekavona oka sa. Oshishi to piyaaneke omuhongi?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yesus ina kala e na ko nasha neehapu vi ya popya, ndele okwa lombwela omuwiliki woshinagoga a ti, “Ino tila, itaela ike.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ndele Yesus ina pitika nande omunhu e mu landule, kakele kuPeetulusa, Yakopo nomumwaina Yohanesa. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Nhyi ye ya peumbo lyomuwiliki wOshinagoga, okwa mona engwagwano maanhu, taa lili mopale yo taa hekumuna. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Yesus okwa ya meni, ndele ta ti kuyo, “Oshishi mwa ngwagwana? Omolwashi a mu lili? Okakavona inaka sa, oka kofa ike!”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Aanhu oye mu yola. Yesus okwa ta mo aanhu ayehe ya ye pondje, ta kufa he nayina yokakavona, namba ya li naye, ndele taa yi meni mu mwa nangala okakavona. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesus okwa kwata oshikaha shokakavona, ndele ta ti ku ko, “Talita, kumi,” nhyi a shi ti, “Kakavona, andi ku lombwele, penduka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Viyaviya okakavona oka penduka, a ka tameke okweenda noya li ya kwatwa kehaluko enene. Okakavona oka li ke na eevula omulongo nambali. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ndele Yesus okwe ya londova, ina ye shi lombwela nande omunhu, ndele okwe ya lombwela ya pe okakavona oikulya.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesus ta anywa muNasaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateusa13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Lukasa4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesus okwa za ko kehala ngho, ndele ta yi koshilando shambilyawo, naalongwa yaye oye mu landula. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Mesiku lyEsabati, okwa tameka okulonga aanhu moshinagoga. Aanhu oyendji mba ya li ye mu pwaikina, oya li ya kumwa ndele taa pula taa ti, “Ayihe mbi okwei hanga peni? Ounongo mbu e na, okwe wu kufa peni? Oikumwifalonga mbi ote yi longo ngeepi? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ndele oye mu anya taa ti, ke shi hano omuhongi woipilangi, omona waMalia, omumwaina waYakopo, Yosef, Yudas naSimoni? Aamwaina aakiinhu kapo ye li puse mha hamba?”<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Aahunganeki iha vinwa pamwe pwiilili, omoshilando tuu shambilyawo, kuyakwawo nokaaneumbo lyao.<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Onghee Yesus kali tavulu ali okuningila ko oshikumwifalonga shasha, kakele kokutenheka omake kaanauvu yamwe nokuya yeluva. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Ndele okwa li kuminwa okuhaitaela kwawo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesus ta tumu aalongwa omulongo nayaali</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateusa10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Lukasa9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Kuza mho, Yesus okwa ya komikunda vopopepi, ndele ta longo aanhu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Yesus okwa ifana aalongwa yaye omulongo nayaali, ndele te ya tumu ooyaali nooyaali, ndele te ya pe eenghono vokupangela eemhepo va kaka. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Okwe ya lombwela ta ti, “Inamu ya nasha mondjila, kakele kondibo, hamboloto, hamhunda yokweenda nayo, nenge oimaliwa meendjato vawo. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Zaleni eenghaku, ndele inamu hinda oikutu iyali. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Kehe meumbo mu amu yi, ndele omwa tambulwako, kaleni mo, siyo amu fiye po ehala ndyo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Nge ope na pehala mha mya ya ndele ina mu tambulwa ko, nye iha mu pwaikinwa, ze ni ko, ndele amu ipupula ondwi keemhavi, sho shi ninge elondovo kuyo.<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Opo nee, aalongwa oya ya, taa uvifa kutya aanhu nayi itevulule. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Oya ta mo eemhepo va kaka ovidji, taa yaeke aanauvu oyendji nomaavi, noku ya yeluva.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eso lyaYohanesa omushashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateusa14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Lukasa9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Ohamba Helodesa oya uva ayihe mbi Yesus a li ta longo, oshonhyi evina lyaYesus olya hangikwa lya shiikwa akuhe. Aanhu yamwe oya li taa ti, “Ngu oYohanesa omushashi a umuka kousi, sho osho nee e na eenghono, vokulonga oikumwifalonga.<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Ndele yamwe oya li taa ti, “OElia. Yamwe oya li taa ti, omuhunganeki umwe womaahunganeki yonale.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Helodesa nhyi eshi uva okwa ti, “OYohanesa Omushashi. Ondemu tetifa omutwe, ndele okwa umuka ko kousi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Molwanhyi Helodesa oye a kwatifa po Yohanesa, a mangwe nomalyenge, ndele ta tulwa movologo omolwa Herodias, omukulukavi wamumwaina Filipus ngu Helodesa a li a hombola po. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Onghee nee, Yohanesa Omushashi okwa kala nokulombwela Helodesa, “Inashi pitikwa, u hombole omukiinhu wamumwanyoko!”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Herodias okwa kala e mu kwatela onghone, nokwa kala a hala oku mu vipaa, ndele okwa li a nyengwa, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />shaanhyi Helodesa okwa li a tila Yohanesa. Helodesa okwa li eshi shii kutya Yohanesa omulumenhu omuwa nomuyuuki, onghee okwa li a yama kuye. Okwa kala e hole oku mu pwaikina, nonande a ka kala ha piyaanekwa neenghono, kehe efimbo temu uvu.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Hwiinina, Herodias okwa mono omhito mesiku lyevalo lyaHelodesa, nhyi Helodesa a ningila omalenga, aawiliki yoita naakulunhu yomuGalilea oshitufi mesiku lyevalo lyaye. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Omonamatikavona waHerodias nhyi e ya moshitufi, okwa vana ouvano wa mwenyeka Helodesa naaenda yaye. Ohamba Helodesa oya lombwela okakavona ya ti, “Indila nge kehe nhyi wa hala, andi shi ku pe.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Ndele okwa ana nokuuvanekela okakavona ta ti, “Kehe nhyi to indile nge, andi shi kupe, nande etata lyouhamba wange!”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Okakavona oka ya kuyina pondje, ndele taka pula yina ka ti, “Nandi indile shike?” Yina okwa yamukula a ti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">“Omutwe wa Yohanesa Omushashi.<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Viyaviya, okakavona oka shuna kohamba taka endelele, ndele taka indile ohamba ka ti, “Onda hala u pe nge omutwe wa Yohanesa omushashi moshiyaha.<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Ohamba Helodesa oya nyika oluhovi olunene, ndele omolweano lyaye ndi a ninga komeho yaayenda, ina vula oku shi anya. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ohamba oya tuma omukwaita womaatonateli yovologo, ndele temu lombwela a ete omutwe waYohanesa. Okwa ya kovologo, ndele te mu tete omutwe, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />ndele ta eta omutwe waye moshiyaha, tewu pe okakavona, ndele ake wu fala kuyina. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Aalongwa yaYohanesa nhyi yeshi uva oye ya, ndele taa kufa mo omuviba waye taye wu tula mombila.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta kutifa aalumenhu omayovi yatano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateusa14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lukasa9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohanesa6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Aatumwa nhyi ya aluka, ndele taa ongala puYesus, oye mu hokololela ashihe nhyi ya ninga nanhyi ya longa. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Okwa li ku na aanhu oyendji taye ya yo taa yi, onghee kaya li ye na efimbo lyokulya. Yesus okwa lombwela aalongwa ya ye ta ti, “Ileni tu yeni, tu ke ikaleleni, opo tu fuveipo kashona. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Oya londa mokawato, ndele taa yi, yeke ikalela.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Oyendji mba ya li ye ya mona nhyi taa yi, oye ya tetekele kolupavi, taa endelele, ya za moilando ayihe, noya fiki tango kehala nghu Yesus naalongwa yaye ya li ya uka. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Hano nhyi Yesus a fika komukunghulo, okwa zamo mokawato, ndele okwa mona ongudu onene yaanhu, nokwa li e ya uvitile onghenda, molwanhyi oya li ya fa eezi ka vina omusita, ndele okwa tameka oku ya longa oinima oyindji. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Nhyi kwa toka, aalongwa yaye oye ya kuye taa ti, “IOtu li mehala kamu na omaumbo, netango olya toka, <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />lekela aanhu ya ye keehambo nokomikunda vopoushiinda, ye ke ilandele oikulya.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Ya peni oikulya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Oya ti kuye, “Ondado yoikulya yaanhu ye fike mha, oi li pomafele yaali. Natu ye tu ka longife po oimaliwa ayihe mbi, tuka lande eemboloto tu ya pe ya lye?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesus okwe ya pula a ti, “Omu na po eemboloto ngapi? Indeni, muka tale kutya ovi li ngapi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Nhyi ya mona kutya ovili ngapi, oya ti, “Otu na eemboloto nhano neehi mbali.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Yesus okwa lombwela aalongwa yaye, ya lombwele aanhu ayehe, ya kale omutumba meengudu, pomwiivi wa ziza. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Aanhu oya kala omutumba meengudu, eengudu vimwe ova li vi na aanhu efele navimwe ova li vi na aanhu omilongo nhano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yesus okwa kufa eemboloto nhano neehi mbali, ta tala keulu, ndele ta pandula Kalunga. Okwa topola eemboloto ndele, te vi pe aalongwa yaye, ye vi topolele aanhu. Okwa topola natango eehi mbali va wana aanhu ayehe. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Aanhu ayehe oya lya, ndele taa kuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Aalongwa oya toola oupambu weemboloto noweehi auhe mbu wa hupa po, wa uva oimbale omulongo naiyali. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Omwaalu waalumenhu mba ya li ya kutifwa owa li omayovi yatano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta ende kombada yomeya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mateusa14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohanesa6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Viyaviya Yesus okwa ninga aalongwa yaye ya londe mowato, opo ye mu tetekele komeho, ya ye ku Betsaida kombiga yimwe yefuta, mhanga ye ta lekele aanhu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Nhyi a lekela aanhu, okwa londa kondudu a ka yalikane. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Nhyi kwa toka, owato oya li pokati kefuta, mhanga Yesus a li komutunda. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Yesus okwa mona kutya aalongwa yaye oye na oupyakavi mokuhinga owato yao, molwomhepo ndji ya li tai ya zilile komeho. Ndele efimbo lyopokati konhatu nohamano yongula, Yesus okwe ya kuyo ta ende kombada yomeya nokwa li e li poku ya pitilila. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ndele nhyi ye mu mona ta ende kombada yomeya, oya li ye shii oshiluli. Oya kuu mopale, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />shaanhyi oya li ya tila hnyi ye mu mona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Ndele viyaviya Yesus okwe ya popifa a ti, “Kaleni nomukumo, Aame, ina mu tila.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Okwa ya nayo mowato, nomhepo oya lotela. Aalongwa oya li ya kumwa ko unene, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />molwanhyi oya li natango ya nyengwa okuuva ko oshiningwanima sheemboloto nhyi a shiti, ndele omitima vawo ova li va kukuta.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva aanauvu muGenesaret</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mateusa14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Yesus naalongwa yaye oya taulukile kombiga onghwawo komutunda kuGenesaret, noya mangele owato komunghulo. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Nhyi ya zamo mowato, aanhu oya vibulula Yesus. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Oya enda noshitopolwa ashihe, ndele taa kufa aanauvu ayehe, yeya hinda poyiinda, ndele taye ya fala kehala kehe nghu taa uvu kutya Yesus e li. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Ndele kehe mha Yesus ta yi, momikunda, moshilando, nokeehambo, aanhu oyali taya eta aanauvu pomahala yaandjuka, taye mu indile a pitike aanauvu ya kume nande okomungege wonguwo yaye. Ndele ayehe mba ye yi kwata, oya yeluvwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Elongo lyaakwamhungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mateusa15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Aafalisai nayamwe yomaalongimhango mba ya za kuJerusalem, oya ongala puYesus. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Oya koneka kutya yamwe yomaalongwa yaYesus oya li taa li oikulya neenyala inavi kohwa nawa.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Aafalisai nAayuuda ayehe ohaa landula omalongo yaakulu yonale, iha ya li mhanga ina ya koha eenyala vawo she ikwatelela keenghulunghevi voohekulu,<verse eid="MRK 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />yo iha ya li sha, sha za komalandifilo ina shi kohwa. Ohaa landula eenghulunghevi vikwawo vimwe nganhyi, omukalo mbu ye na okukoha omakopi, eembiya, oiyaha yongopolo noiketifa.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Opo nee, Aafalisai naalongimhango oya pula Yesus ya ti, “Omolwashi aalongwa yoye ihaa landula omalongo yaakulu yonale, ndele ohaa li neenyala ina vi kohwa nawa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Aanaineya nye, Jesaya okwe mu hunganekela oshili nghanhyi a shanga kutya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">Kalunga ota ti, ‘Aanhu ohaa simanekenge nomapopyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">ndele omitima vawo ovi li kokule naame.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Oku simaneka nge kwawo okwongaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">otaa longo omalongo yoipango yopaunhu.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Amu efa oipango yaKalunga, nye amu viinine omalongo yopaunhu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesus okwe ya lombwela a ti, “Omu na omikalo veni vomakoto vokwaanya eemhango vaKalunga nye amu landula omalongo yeni yene! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Moses okwa tile, ‘Simaneka ho nanyoko. Nangu ta tuku he nenge yina oku na oku vipawa.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ndele omwa longa kutya, omunhu nge oku na sha, nhyi ta vulu oku kwafa nasho he nenge yina, oshi li mondjila okutya, ‘Nhyi oKorban’ sha hala kutya nhyi osha Kalunga, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />nena inamu mu pitika a kwafe he nenge yina. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Momukalo mbu, amu ningi eehapu vaKalunga vi kale vafa kavi na eenghono, molwanhyi omwa longa aanhu ya landule omalongo nomifiyululwakalo veni. Nye amu ningi natango oinima ikwawo oyindji yafa mha.<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oinima mbi tai kakeke omunhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mateusa15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesus okwa ifana natango ongudu yaanhu, ye uye kuye, ndele te ya lombwele ta ti, “Pwaikineni kwaame amuhe, nye mu uve ko. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Kape na nhyi shili kombada, nge ashi yi momunhu, ashi mu ningi a kale ina hokiwa kuKalunga, ndele oshonhyi ashi zi momunhu osho ashi mu ningi a kale ina hokiwa kuKalunga!.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omanyolo yamwe oye na ovelise omulongo nahamano.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Ngu ena omakutwi, na uve ko!”<note caller="+" style="f" /><verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Yesus nhyi a topoka nongudu yaanhu, okwa ya meumbo lyonhumba. Aalongwa yaye oye mu pula a fatulule nhyi a popya. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Hamba nanye kamu na eenduge? Kamu uvite nani kutya oikulya mbi tayi yi momunhu tayi zi pondje, hayo tayi kakeke omunhu, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />molwanhyi oikulya ihayi yi momutima waye, ndele otayi yi mepunda, ndele tayi zimo pomukalo wopaushitwe.” Mokupopya nhyi, Yesus okwa koleka kutya oikulya ayihe oya yela.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Natango Yesus okwa ti, “Nhyi ashi zi momunhu, osho ashi mu ningi a kale ina kohoka. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Molwanhyi okuza meni momutima womunhu omo hamu zi omavilaavilo omayi, oipala, oulunga, evipao, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />oluhondelo, onyanya, ekoto, okuhena eiviliko, efupa, okusheka, einenepeko, noulai. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Ouyi mbu auhe ohau zi meni momutima womunhu wo owo tawu mu ningi a kale ina kohoka.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eitaelo lyomukiinhu ngu keshi Omuyuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mateusa15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesus okwa fiya po ehala ndyo, ndele ta yi komikunda vopopepi noshilando shaTilus. Okwa ya meumbo lyonhumba, ka li a hala aanhu ya shiwe mha e li, ndele nee ina vula oku shi holeka. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Moshilando mo omwa li omukiinhu, e na omonakavona e niwe keemhepo va kaka. Nhyi a uva kombiga ya Yesus, meendelelo okwa ya kuye, ndele ta tu eengolo peemhavi vaye. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Omukiinhu ngu ka li Omuyuda. Okwa li a valelwa muFoinikia shomuSiria. Okwa indila Yesus a te mo eemhepo va kaka momonakavona. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Efa ounona wu lye tango, shaanhyi inashi opala okukufa oikulya younona, ndele toyi pe eembwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Omukiinhu okwe mu yamukula a ti, “Eeno, Omwene, neembwa kohi yoshitaafula oha vi li oundjaumuke wounona!”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Omolweyamukulo lyoye, inda keumbo, eemhepo va kaka ova za mo momumwoyekavona!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Omukiinhu okwa ya keumbo nokwa hanga omona a nangala kombete, neemhepo va kaka va za mo muye.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omulumenhu ha kokoma ye omufitamakutwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yesus nhyi a za ko komikunda vopopepi naTilus, okwa pitile moshitopolwa shaSidon, ndele ta yi nondjila yauka koshitopolwa shoilando omulongo yi kefuta lyaGalilea. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Aanhu oye mu etela omulumenhu ha kokoma, ye iha uvu ko noya indila Yesus e mu tenheke oshikaha. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesus okwe mu kufa mo maanhu, ye ke ikalele. Okwa tula ominwe vaye momakutwi yomufitamakutwi, ndele te isiile omate komunwe waye, ndele ta piya elaka lyomulumenhu. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Yesus okwa tala keulu, ta fuva mopale, ndele ta ti, “Efata!” nhyi ashi ti, “Fituluka!”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Viyaviya, omakutwi yaye oya fituluka, ndele ta tameke oku uva ko nawa, nelaka lyaye olya manguluka, ndele ta tameke ku popya nawa. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesus okwa keelela aanhu opo ina ye shi popya nande okulye. Ndele nande ongaanhyo, oye shi hokolola. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Aanhu oya li ya kumwa unene, ndele taa ti, “Kehe shimwe nhyi ta longo oshiwa! Aafitamakutwi ote ya ningi ya uve ko, neembolo ote vi ningi vi popye!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesus ta kutifa aanhu yefike lwopomaovi yane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mateusa15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Pomasiku ngo, ongudu onghwawo onene yaanhu oya ongala oku pwaikina Yesus. Ndele nhyi kaya li ye na nhyi taa li, Yesus okwa ifana aalongwa yaye, ndele ta ti kuyo, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Aanhu mba ondi ya uvitile onghenda, shaanhyi oya menekela pwaame omasiku yatatu, onghee nganhyi kaye na ali nhyi taa lile po mha. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Ndele nge onde ya lekela ya ye komaumbo yawo inaa lya sha, otaa ka pundukila mondjila, shaanhyi yamwe yomuyo oya za kokule.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Aalongwa yaye oye mu yamukula, “Oikulya otayi zi peni mokuti mu, yi vule okukutifa aanhu yefike mha?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesus okwe ya pula, “Omu na po eemboloto ngapi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Yo oya ti, “Opu na eemboloto heyali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Yesus okwa lombwela aanhu, ya kale omutumba pevu. Okwa kufa eemboloto vo heyali, ndele ta pandula Kalunga. Okwe vi pambula, ndele te vi pe aalongwa yaye, ye vi topolele aanhu. Aalongwa oya ninga nganhyi Yesus e ya lombwela ya ninge. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Oya li ye na po nouhi oushona, ndele Yesus okwa lombwela aalongwa yaye yewu topolele po aanhu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Aanhu oya lya, ndele taa kuta. Konima aalongwa oya toola po oupambu mbu wa hupa po, oimbale oinene iheyali ya uva. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Opwa li pu na aanhu yefike lwopomauvi yane, na Yesus okwe ya lekela. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Yesus okwa yi mowato naalongwa yaye, ndele taa yi koshitopolwa shaDalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aafalisai taa pula oshikumwifalonga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mateusa12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Aafalisai oye ya Yesus, noya tameke oku mu pula omapulo. Oye mu pula a ninge oshikumwifalonga sha za keulu, opo ya kwashilipaleke kutya okwa za ku Kalunga shili. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesus okwa fuva mopale, ndele ta ti, “Omolwashike epipi ndi lya hala okutalifwa oshikumwifalonga? Oshili andi mu lombwele kutya, epipi ndi iha li talifwa nande oshikumwifalonga sha sha!”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Okwe ya fiya po, ndele ta yi mowato nokwa taulukile kombinga onghwawo yefuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efulika lyAafalisai nolyaHelodesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mateusa16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Aalongwa oya li ya vimbwa okweetelela eemboloto va wana. Nomowato oya hangikwa ike ye na mo omboloto yimwe. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesus okwe ya kumaiva a ti, “Kotokeni, nye mu ikeelele efulika lyAafalisai nolya Helodesa.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Aalongwa oya tameke okukundafana taa ti, “Ota ti nghaanhyi molwanhyi ka tu na eemboloto.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesus nhyi e shi vibulula, okwa ti kuyo, “Omolwashi amu ilombwele kutya, omolwahnyi inamu za ko neemboloto? Inamu koneka nye kamu uvite ko natango? Omitima veni ova kukuta? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Omeho omu ya na, kamu wete ko? Omakutwi omu ya na, kamu uvite ko? Nye ihamu vibuluka <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />nhyi nda topolelele eemboloto nhano kaanhu omayovi yatano, oimbale ingapi mwa li mwa toola ya uva oundjaumuke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Aalongwa oya ti kuye, “Omulongo naiyali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo natango, “Ihamu vibuluka noho nhyi nda topolelele aanhu omayovi yane eemboloto heyali, kutya oimbale ingapi mwa toola ya uva oundjaumuke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Oya ti kuye, “Iheyali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Ye okwa ti kuyo, “Kamu uvite ko natango.”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omulumenhu omuposi puBetsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Nhyi ya fika muBetsaida, aanhu yamwe oya eta omulumenhu omuposi kuYesus, ndele oya indila Yesus e mu kume. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesus okwa kwata omuposi meke, ndele te mu fala kondje yoshilando. Okwe mu siila omate pomeho, ndele te mu tenheke omake yaye, ndele te mu pula ta ti, “Ou wete sha?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Omulumenhu okwa yelula omeho, ndee ta ti, “Ondi wete aanhu, ndele ondi ya wete ya fa omiti avi ende.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesus natango okwa tenheka omake yaye pomeho yomulumenhu, nomulumenhu okwa kala ewete ko, naayihe okwa li e yi wete nawa. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesus okwe mu lekela a ye keumbo ta ti, “Ino shuna mo ali moshilando.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peetulusa ta popi mo kutya Yesus oye Kilistus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mateusa16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Lukasa9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesus okwa ya pamwe naalongwa yaye komikunda vaKesarea Filippi. Mhanga ye li mondjila, Yesus okwe ya pula a ti, “Aanhu ohaa tile nge ngeepi, aame lye?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Oye mu yamukula ya ti, “Yamwe otaa ti ooye Yohanesa omushashi, yamwe otaa ti ooye Elia, nayamwe otaa ti ooye umwe womaahunganeki.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Ndele Yesus okwe ya pula natango ta ti, “Nye amu ti aame lye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Peetulusa okwe mu yamukula a ti, “Ooye Kilistus.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yesus okwe ya londova neenghono, inaye shipopya nande okomunhu.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta tengeneke ehepeko, eso neumuko lyaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mateusa16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Lukasa9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Yesus okwa tameka oku longa aalongwa yaye ta ti, “Omonamati wOmunhu oku na okuhepekwa nomahepeko omendji nota ka anywa kaakulunhu, aawiliki yaayambi nokaalongimhango. Ye ota ka vipawa, ndele esiku etitatu ota ka umuvwa.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Ndele Yesus okwe shi popya mo shayela, ine shi holeka, naPeetulusa okwe mu ifana po, ye ke ikalele, ndele ta tameke oku mu ngada. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ndele Yesus okwa tanauka, ta tala kaalongwa yaye, ndele ta ngada Peetulusa ta ti, “Za po pwaame, Satana, shaanhyi nhyi to vilaavila ina shi za kuKalunga, ndele oshopaunhu!”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Yesus okwa ifana ongudu yaanhu pamwe naalongwa yaye, ye uye kuye, ndele ta ti kuyo, “Nge opu na ngu a hala okulandula nge, ne ivibwe ye mwene, na hinde omushiyakano waye, ndee ta landula nge. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Oshonhyi ngu a hala oku hupifa omwenyo waye, ote ke wu kanifa, ndele ngu ta kanifa omwenyo waye molwange nomolwonghundana oiwa, ote wu hupifa. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ashi kwafa shike, omunhu nande ne ilikolele ouyuni auhe, ndele ta kanifa omwenyo waye! <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Omunhu ota vulu oku yandja shi shi ninge ekulilo lyomwenyo waye? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Nge opu na ngu ta si nge ohoni neehapu vage mokati kepipi ndi lyaahondeli nolyaalunde, nena Omonamati wOmunhu ote ke mu sa ohoni, nhyi te ke ya e li meyavimo lyaHe pamwe naayengeli aayapuki.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesus okwa twikila ko ta ti, “Oshili, andi mu lombwele, opu na yamwe yomumba ya fikama mha, ihaa si, mhanga inaa mona ouhamba waKalunga ta wuuya neenghono vao.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta lunduluka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mateusa17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Lukasa9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Omasiku yahamano nhyi ya pita po, Yesus okwa kufa Peetulusa, Yakopo naYohanesa, ndee okwe ya fala kondudu ondeka, ye ke ikalela. Manga ye li ngho, Yesus okwa lunduluka monhaneho yawo, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />ndele noikutu yaye oya avima yatoka tootoo, nokombada yevu kaku na nande omunhu ta vulu oku yi tokifa. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ndele aalongwa mba yatatu oya mona Elia naMoses taa popi naYesus. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Peetulusa okwa lombwela Yesus ta ti, “Mulongi, poima mha opwe tu opalela okukala. Atu ka vika po omatwali yatatu, limwe olyoye, limwe olyaMoses nalimwe olyaElia.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Peetulusa nayakwao oya li ya tila neenghono, na kali eshii nhyi e na okutya.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Oshikoo oshe ya ndele ashi ya siikile, nomoshikoo nhyo omwa za ewi lya ti, “Ingu oye Omonamati Wange Omuholike, mu uveni!”<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Ndele viyaviya nhyi ya keyauka, kaya li ye wete po ali umwe, oYesus ike e li nayo.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ndele nhyi ya li taa londoloka kondudu, Yesus okwe ya kumaiva, opo inaa popya nande okomunhu nhyi ya mona, mhanga Omonamati wOmunhu ina umuka kousi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Oya tambulako elombwelo ndyo, ndele oya kala taa pulafana kombiga yokuumuka kousi nhyi ashi ti. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Oya pula Yesus ya ti, “Omolwashike aalongimhango taa ti kutya Elia ote ke ya tango kuKilistus?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Eeno, Elia ote ya tango, ye ta longekiva ayihe. Ndele ongeepi hano, Omonamati wOmunhu a shangwa kutya oku na okuhepekwa omahepeko omendji nokwaanywa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ndele andi mu lombwele, Elia okwe uya, ndele oye mu ningila kehe nhyi ya li ya hala okumuningila, nganhyi sha shangwa momishangwa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta yeluva omumati ena omhepo ya kaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-20">Mateusa17:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Lukasa9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ndele Yesus naPeetulusa, naYohanesa naYakopo nhyi ye ya kaalongwa yakwawo, oye ya hanga ye li mokati kaanhu oyendji, naalongimhango yamwe oya li taa tu eemhata nayo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Aanhu nhyi ya mona Yesus, oya kumwa ko, noya matukile kuye ye mu kunde. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesus okwa pula aalongwa a ti, “Amu tu eemhata ova shi nayo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Wumwe womongudu okwe mu yamukula, “Mulongi, onda eta kooye omumwangemati ena omhepo ya kaka ndji ye mu ninga a kale iha popi. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Shaa omhepo ya kaka nhyi tayi mu ponokele, ota yi mu vege pohi, ndele ta zi onhutu mokanya, nokwiikeha komayoo, ye te yi kukutile. Onda li nda lombwela aalongwa yoye, ye yi temo, ndele oya nyengwa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Onye epipi kali na eitaelo, siyo onaini andi kala punye? Siyo onaini ndi noku mu ivivimikila? Eteni omumati kwaame.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Oye mu eta ku Yesus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Nhyi omhepo ya kaka ya mona Yesus, oya mbugaambuga omumati, ndele te ivege pevu, ta alangata, ye ta zi onhutu mokanya. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesus okwa pula he yomumati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">“Okwa kala nasho efimbo li fike peni?” He yomomati okwa ti, “Okuza kounona waye. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Olundji omhepo ya kaka oya kambavala oku mu vipaa, oku mu undulila momundilo nomomeya. Ndele oye nge oto vulu okuninga po sha, tu sila onghenda, oye u tu kwafe!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Omolwashike to ti, nge andi shi vulu? Kehe shimwe ashi vulu okuningilwa omunhu ngu a itaela.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Meendelelo, he yomumati okwa ingiva a tya omahovi, “Ondi na eitaelo, ndele eshona, kwafa okuhaitayela kwange!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesus nhyi a mona aanhu taa ngudumanene po, okwa hanyena omhepo ya kaka a ti, “Mhepo oye iho popi oye iho uvu ko, za mo muye, na ino ya mo ali muye nande!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Ndele omhepo ya kaka oya ingiva, yo ta yi mu mbugaambuga neenghono, ndele ta yi zi mo muye. Konima, omumati okwa li a fa ke na omwenyo, naanhu oyendji oya ti, “Okwa sa.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ndele Yesus okwe mu kwata monyala yaye, te mu yambiviva a fikame.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Konima yefimbo nhyi Yesus a ya meumbo, aalongwa yaye oye mu pula mhanga ye li oyo ayeke ya ti, “Omolwashike twa nyengwa oku ta mo omhepo ya kaka ndjo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Oluvi lwomhepo ya fa ndji, ihayi tewa mo kusha shimwe, okeyalikano alike.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta popi natango eso lyaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mateusa17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Lukasa9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesus naalongwa yaye oya za ko, ya pitila muGalilea. Yesus ka li a hala aanhu ya shiwe mha e li, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />shaanhyi okwa li ta longo aalongwa yaye. Okwe ya lombwela kutya, “Omonamati wOmunhu ota ka yandjwa momake yaanhu mba ta ye ke mu vipaa, konima yomasiku yatatu, ota ka umuka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ndele ka ya li ye uvite ko kutya okwa hala okutya shi, noya li ya tila okumu pula.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omunene olye?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateusa18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Lukasa9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Yesus naalongwa yaye nhyi ya fika muKapelenaum, okwa ya meumbo nokwa pula aalongwa ya ye ta ti, “Omwa li amu kundafana shike mondjila?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ndele oya kala ya mwena, shaanhyi mondjila oya li ta yeyi pula kutya olye omunene e vule yakwawo ayehe. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesus okwa kala omutumba, ndele ta ifana aalongwa omulongo nayaali, ndele ta ti kuyo, “Ngu a hala, a kale wotango, na kale wa huunina kwaayehe nomuyakuli waayehe.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Okwa kufa okaana, ndele te ka fikameke komeho yao, okwe ka papatela, nokwa ti kuyo, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />‘Kehe tuu ngu ta tambula ko okaana ngha mevina lyange, ota tambula nge, nangu ta tambula nge, haame auke ta tambula, ndele ota tambula nangu a tuma nge.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngu ke li omhinge nase okwa ama kuse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Lukasa9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohanesa okwa ti kuYesus; “Mulongi, otwa mona omunhu umwe ta te mo eemhepo va kaka mevina lyoye, ndele otwe mu keelela, shaanhyi ka li womongudu yetu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti; “Inamu mu keelela, shaanhyi kaku na ngu ta longo oilonganghono mevina lyange, nokonima yefimbo ota popile nge mouyi. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Oshonhyi kehe ngu ke li omhinge nase, okwa ama kuse. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Ame andi mu lombwele oshili, kehe ngu te mu pe omeya yokumwa molwanhyi eshii kutya nye oya Kilistus, iha kala ina pewa ondjabi yaye.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elondovo kombiga yokuhongolola omunhu a nyone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mateusa18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Lukasa17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Kehe ngu ta hongolola kamwe komoushona mbu wa itaela nge ka nyone, oshiwa a mangelwe emanya eviyu mofingo yaye, ndele ta umbilwa mefuta. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Onyala yoye nge ota yi ku hongolola u nyone, yi teta ko. Oku ya momwenyo waaluhe ushilema oku hwepo, ku vulife okukala neenyala mbali, ndele to yi moheli, mo mu na omundilo ihau vimi po aluhe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omafatululo yamwe oya weva mo ovelise. Mo nomainyo taa li ombelela yawo, ihaa si, nomu na omundilo ihau vimi po siyo aluhe</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Nomhavi yoye nge otayi ku hongolola u nyone, yi teta ko. Okuya momwenyo waaluhe u na omhavi yimwe oshihwepo shi vulife oku kala neemhavi mbali oye to umbilwa moheli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omafatululo yamwe oya weva mo ovelise 46: Mo omainyo taa li ombelela yawo, yo ihaa si, nomu na omundilo ihau vimi po siyo aluhe.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Neiho lyoye nge ota li ku hongolola u nyone, li tsipula mo. Okuya mouhamba waKalunga u na eiho limwe okuhwepo ku vulife okukala nomeho yaali oye to umbilwa moheli, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />mo omainyo ihaa si, nomu na omundilo ihau vimi po siyo aluhe.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Omunhu kehe oku na okuyelifwa nomundilo nganhyi efikiloyambo ha li yelifwa nomongwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Omongwa omuwa, ndele omongwa nge tau tutuka, otau vulu ngeepi oku fingalekwa ali?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Kaleni mu na oukwatya wa fa womongwa, nye mu kale mu na ombili nayakweni.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta longo kombiga yehengafano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mateusa19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lukasa16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesus okwa fiya po ehala ndyo, ndele ta yi koshitopolwa shaYudea, ndele ta yi kombiga onghwawo yomulonga waYoldan. Aanhu oyendji oye ya kuye nokwe ya longa nghanhyi ha ningi shito.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Aafalisai yamwe oye ya kuye, ta ye mu pula nelalakano lyoku mu mona ousama taati; “Osha pitikwa tuu omulumenhu a henge po omukiinhu waye?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula nepulo a ti, “Moses okwe mu lombwela ngeepi kombiga yehengafano?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Ndele oya ti, “Moses okwa pitika, omulumenhu a shange ozapo yehengo, opo a vule oku fiya po omukiinhu waye.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Moses okwe mu shangela oshipango nhyi, omolwoukukutu womitima veni. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ndele petameko lyeshito, Kalunga okwa shita omulumenhu nomukiinhu. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Onghee hano omulumenhu e na okufiya po he nayina, ndele taa hangana nomukiinhu waye, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />ayehe yaali otaa kala onga olutu lumwe. ‘Kaye shi ali yaali, ndele oye li onga olutu lumwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Hano nhyi Kalunga a tula kumwe, ka pu na omunhu a pitikwa eshi kufe kumwe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ndele nhyi ya ya meumbo, aalongwa oya pula Yesus natango oshiima nhyi. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Ndele okwe ya lombwela a ti, “Omulumenhu ngu ta henge po omukiinhu waye, ndele ta hombola po umwe, ota hondele mokukala keshi omwiinekelwa komukulukavi waye wotango. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Nomukiinhu nge ota henge po omulumenhu waye, ndele ta hombolwa kuumwe, ota hondele.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta yambeke ounona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateusa19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lukasa18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Aanhu yamwe oya eta ounona kuYesus, opo e wu yambeke, ndele aalongwa oya ngada mba ye u yeta. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Nhyi Yesus e shi vibulula, okwa hanya ndele ta ti kuyo, “Efeni ounona wuuye kwaame, inamu wu keelela ko, shaanhyi ouhamba waKalunga owa mba ye wu fa. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Oshili andi mu lombwele, “Ngu iha tambula ouhamba waKalunga nganhyi okaana, iha yi mo muwo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Yesus okwa papatele ounona momaako yaye, ndele te wu tenheke omake yaye, ndele te wu yambeke.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omulumenhu omuyamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateusa19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lukasa18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Ndele nhyi Yesus a za mo meumbo, moku twikila ondjila yaye, omulumenhu umwe okwa matuka e ya ku Yesus, e mu shakeneka, ndele ta tu eengolo koshipala shaye, ndele te mu pula ta ti, “Mulongi omuwa, nandi ninge shike opo ndi mone omwenyo waaluhe?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesus okwe mu pula, “Omolwashike to ifana nge omuwa? Kaku na nande umwe omuwa, oKalunga ike. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Oipango owu yi shi, ‘Ino vipaa, ino hondela, ino yaka, ino lundila, ino kengelela omunhu, simaneka ho nanyoko.’”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Omulumenhu okwe mu yamukula, “Mulongi, ayihe mbi onde yi wanifa okuza kounyasha wange.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesus okwe mu tala nohole, ndele ta ti kuye, “Ouna oshiima shimwe wa pumbwa oku shi ninga, inda u ka landife po oinima yoye ayihe, ndee oimaliwa toyi pe eehepele, ndee to kala wu na eliko meulu, ndee to yaluka u landule nge.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Omulumenhu okwa li a uvifwa nayi keehapu vi, ndele ta zi po, a handuka shaanhyi okwa li e na eliko olindji.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesus okwa tala aalongwa yaye ndee ta ti kuyo, “Oshiviyu ngeepi aakengeli ya ye mOuhaamba wa Kalunga!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Aalongwa oya kuminwa eehapu vaye. Ndele Yesus okwa twikila noku ya lombwela ta ti, “Aamwange, oshiviyu ngeepi okuya mOuhamba waKalunga!” <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />“Okupita kwongamelo mombululu yongwiya okupu ku vule okuya kwomuyamba mOuhamba waKalunga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Aalongwa oya li ya haluka neenghono, ndele taa pulafana taa ti, “Olye hano ta vulu okuhupifwa nani?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesus okwe ya tala, ndele ta ti kuyo, “Nhyi otashi nyenge aanhu, ndele kuKalunga, ayihe ota yi vulika.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Peetulusa okwa ti kuye, “Tala, se otwa fiya po ayihe, ndee atu ku landula.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesus okwa ti, “Oshili andi mu lombwele, kaku na ngu a fiya po eumbo nenge aamwayina aalumenhu nenge aamwayina aakiinhu, nenge he, nenge yina, nenge oyana, nenge epya lyaye molwange nomolwokutandaelifa Onghundana Oiwa, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />ndele ihaka mona lwefele oinima mbi mouyuni mbu; Omaumbo, aamwayina aalumenhu naamwayina aakiinhu, ooyina, oyana, omapya nosho wo omahepeko. Nomouyuni mbu tawu ke ya ota ka mona omwenyo waaluhe. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Ndele oyendji mba aatango, otaa ka ninga aahwiinini, naahwiinini otaa ka ninga aatango.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta popi natango eso lyaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateusa20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Lukasa18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesus naalongwa yaye oya li mondjila taa yi ku Yelusalema. Yesus okwa li oye e ya kwatela komeho. Aalongwa yaye oya li ya kumwa ko, naanhu mba ya landula mo oya li ya tila kutya ngiika otaka ningilwa shi, nghu ya uka. Yesus okwa kufa po aalongwa yaye omulongo nayaali yeke ikalela, ta tameke okuya lombwela nhyi ashi ke mu ningilwa, <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />a ti, “Pwaikineni, atu yeni kuYelusalema, nghu Omonamati wOmunhu taka yandjwa momake yaawiliki yaayambi noyaalongimhango, notaye ke mu tokolela eso, ndele otaye ke mu yandja momake yamba kaye shi Aayuda, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />mba taye ke mu sheka, taye ke mu siila omate, taye ke mu vega neengola, ndele taye ke mu vipaya, ndele konima yomasiku yatatu, ota ka umuka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eindilo lyaYakopo naYohanesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mateusa20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Yakopo naYohanesa oyanamati yaSebedeus, oye ya kuYesus ndele taa ti, “Mulongi, otwa hala u tu ningile nhyi atu ku indile.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesus okwe ya pula a ti, “Omwa hala ndi mu ningile shike?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Oye mu yamukula ya ti, “Nhyi to ka kala omutumba meyavimo lyOuhamba woye, tu pitika, tu ka kale omutumba pamwe nooye, umwe okolulyo lwoye namukwawo okolumoho lwoye.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Kamu shii nhyi amu indile nye. Amu vulu nghaa okumwa meholo elulu lyomahepeko ndi ndi na okuka mwa, nenge otamu ka vula nghaa okushashwa eshasho lyomahepeko nganhyi ndi andi ka shashwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Oya ti kuye, “Atu shi vulu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Eeno, otamu ka mwa meholo mu andi ka mwa, nye ota mu ka shashwa eshasho ndi andi ka shashwa nalyo, <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />ndele kandi na oufemba woku tya olye ta ka kala omutumba kolulyo lwange, nenge kolumoho lwange. O Kalunga ta ka yandja omahala ngo, kumba a hoolola.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Hano aalongwa yakwawo omulongo nhyi ye shi uva, oya handukila Yakopo naYohanesa. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yesus okwe ya ifana ayehe, ndele ta ti kuyo, “Nye omu shi shii kutya Aapangeli yomauhamba yamwe oye na eenghono kombada yaanhu yawo, ndele naanenenhu yawo otaa longifa eenghonopangelo vayo kombada yaanhu yawo. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ndele nhyi hasho shi kale mokati keni. Nge opu na ngu a hala a ninge omunene mokati keni, ye na kale omuyakuli weni, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />nangu womokati keni a hala, a kale a simana kuyakwawo, ye na kale omupika waayehe. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Shaashi nOmonamati wOmunhu ine ya okuyakulwa, ndele okwe ya okuyakula nokuyandja omwenyo waye, a hupife oyendji.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta eluva omuposi Baltimeus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateusa20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lukasa18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Opo nee Yesus naalongwa yaye oye ya muYeliko. Nhyi yali taa zi mo moshilando pamwe nongudu onene yaanhu, Bartimeus yaTimeus, omuheheli omuposi, okwa li omutumba peeha vondjila.<verse eid="MRK 10:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Nhyi a uva kutya OYesus Omunasareta a li ta ende po, okwa tameka okwiingiva mopale ta ti, “Yesus Omonamati waDavid, sila nge onghenda!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Oyendji yomaanhu oye mu ngada a mwene, ndele ye okwa twikila nokwiingiva mopale unene ta ti, “Omonamati wa David, sila nge onghenda!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesus okwa fikama, ndele ta ti, “Mu ifaneni, e uye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Oya ifana omuposi, taa ti kuye, “Kala nomukumo, fikama, Ye ote ku ifana.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Viyaviya okwa kufa mo onguwo yaye, ta fikama viya, ndele te ya kuYesus.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesus okwe mu pula a ti, “Owa hala ndiku ningile shike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Omuposi okwe mu yamukula a ti, “Mulongi, onda hala ndi mone ko natango.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesus okwa ti kuye, “Inda, eitaelo lyoye, olye ku yeluva.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Viyaviya okwa monako, ndele ta landula Yesus.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesus ta tambulwa ko nehafo mu Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateusa21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lukasa19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohanesa12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Hano nhyi ye ya puYelusalema, popepi noshilando Betfage naBetania, oye ya pondudu yeeholivi. Yesus okwa tuma yaali yomaalongwa yaye, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />ndele ta ti kuyo, “Indeni komukunda mbu wuli komeho yeni. Shaa mwa fiki ko, amu ka mona okandoogi oshona ya mangwa, ina yi kayilwa nande onale komunhu. Ka mangululeyi mo, nye mu ka ete nghu. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Ndele ngeege opu na ngu e mu pula kutya, ‘Amu shi ningile shike?’ Mu lombweleni kutya, Omwene okwe ka pumbwa, Ye ote ka yalula viya.”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Oya ya ko, ndele oya mona okandoogi yamangelwa pondje momweelo weumbo. Mhanga ya li ta ye ka mangululamo,<verse eid="MRK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />aanhu yamwe mba ya li ya fikama mho, oye ya pula ya ti; “Amu ningi shi hano nhyo, oshishi a mu mangululamo okandoogi?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Aalongwa oya yamukula nganhyi ya lombwelwa kuYesus, ndele naanhu oye ya efa ya ye. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Nhyi ya eta okandoogi kuYesus, oya yala eenguwo vawo pombuda yokandoogi, Yesus okwa londa ko.<verse eid="MRK 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Aanhu oyendji oya yala eenguwo vao mondjila, mhanga yamwe ya teta oitai yoihwa momapya, ndele taye yi yala mondjila. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Aanhu mba yali komeho namba ya landula mo, oya ingiva taa ti, “Kalunga na hambelelwa, Omuyambekwa oye ngu te ya mevina lyOmwene! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Kalunga na yambeke ouhamba womukwaniilwa David mbu tawu ya! Kalunga na hambelelwe, omukombadambada!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesus nhyi a fika muYelusalema, okwa ya motembeli, ndele ta tala ayihe, nomolwanhyi etango olya li lya toka, okwa ya naalongwa yaye omulongo nayaali kuBetania.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta fingi omukwiyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mateusa21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Esiku lya landula ko, Yesus naalongwa yaye nhyi ya li taa zi kuBetania, Yesus okwa li a sa ondjala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Okwa mona omukwiyu wu li kokule, wa ziza nawa. Okwa ya kuwo, a tale nge ota mono mo eenghwiyu. Nhyi a ya ko, ina mona mo sha, omafo ike, shaanhyi efimbo lyeenghwiyu olya li inali fika.<verse eid="MRK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Yesus okwa ti komukwiyu, “Kaku na ali ngu ta li oiyimati yoye siyo aluhe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Naalongwa yaye oye shi uva nhyi eshi popya.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta opaleke Eumbo lyaKalunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateusa21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Lukasa19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohanesa2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Nhyi ye ya muYelusalema, Yesus okwa ya keumbo lyaKalunga, ndele ta tameke oku ta mo aanhu mba ya li taa landa, yo taa landifa. Okwa taalelifa mombada oitaafula yaapingakanifi yoimaliwa noipundi yaalandifi yeenghuti. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Yesus ina pitika nande omunhu a hinde sha, ta pitile moluumbo lwEumbo lyaKalunga. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Okwe ya longa ta ti, “Hamba inaku shangwa ngaanhyi, ‘Eumbo lyange oli na okwiifanwa eumbo lyeyalikano lyoiwana ayihe.’ Ndele nye omwe li ninga oshiholameno shaanyeki!” <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Aayambi aakulunhu naalongimhango nhyi ye shi uvu, oya tameke okukonga omhito ya vipaye Yesus. Oya li ye mu tila, shaanhyi aanhu ayehe oya kumwa kelongo lyaye.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ousiku nhyi we ya, Yesus naalongwa yaye oya za mo moshilando.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oshilongwa okuza komuti womukwiyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mateusa21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Ongula yesiku lya landula nhyi ya li taa ende mondjila, oya mona omukwiyu wa sa siyo okomivi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Peetulusa okwa vibuluka oshiningwanima nhyo, ndele ta ti kuYesus, “Tala, Mulongi, omukwiyu mbu wa finga, owa sa.”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Kaleni muna eitaelo muKalunga. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Oshili andi mu lombwele, nge ope na ngu ta lombwele ondudu ndji ta ti, ‘Itumba po mha, wu iyekele mefuta,’ nge ke na omalimbililo momutima waye, ndele okwa itaela kutya nhyi ta ti ashi ningwa, nena ote shi ningilwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Onghee andi mu lombwele, “Kehe nhyi amu indile mokuyalikana, itaeleni kutya, omwe shi pewa, no amu ka pewa kehe nhyi a mu pula. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Nge amu yalikana, viminenipo kehe nghaa ngu e mu ninga nayi, opo naHo yeni womeulu a vime po omanyono yeni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omafatululo yamwe oya weva po ovelise 26 Ndele nge ihamu vimine po yakweni, nena naHo yeni womeulu iha vimi po omanyono yeni.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Ndele nge ihamu vimine po yakweni, nena naHo yeni womeulu iha vimi po omanyono yeni.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ta pulwa kombiga yepangelonghono lyaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateusa21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Lukasa20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesus naalongwa yaye oya fika muYelusalema. Mhanga Yesus a li ta ende moluumbo lwEumbo lyaKalunga, aawiliki yaayambi, aalongimhango naakulunhu yoshiwana oye ya kuye, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />ndele ta ye mu pula, “Ayihe mbi oho yi longo nepangelo lipi? Olye e ku pa eenghono nepangelo lyokuninga oinima ya fa mha?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Naame andi mu pula epulo limwe. Nge omwa yamukulange, nena naame andi mu lombwele kutya okepangelo lyalye andi longo oinima ayihe mbi. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Lombweleni nge, eshasho lya Yohanesa olya za peni, oku Kalunga nenge omaanhu?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Oya tameke oku pulafana, “Natu tyeni ngeepi? Nge otwa ti, ‘Oku Kalunga,’ otaka tya, ‘Omolwashike hano inamu itaela Yohanesa?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ndele natango ihatu vulu kutya, ‘Olya za maanhu.’ Oya li ya tila aanhu, shaanhyi aanhu ayehe oya li ya tala Yohanesa kutya oye omuhunganeki. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Oya yamukula Yesus ya ti, “Katu shi shii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Naame ihandi mu lombwele kutya, okepangelo lyalye andi longo ayihe mbi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Eele lyaahiili yepya lyomaviinyu aayinayi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateusa21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Lukasa20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesus okwa tameka oku ya lombwela momayele ta ti, “Okwa li ku na omulumenhu e na epya lyomandjebele. Epya okwe li tula ongubu. Okwa fa oshilambo shokukolela omaviinyu. Okwa tungila mo ongulu yoku kala ngu ta tonatele ehala. Okwa nangeke mo aahiili yepya, ndele ta yi koilongo yokokule. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Efimbo lyokukola nhyi lya fika, okwa tuma omupiya waye kaahiili yomepya lyomandjebele, ye mu pe oiyimati mbi e na okupewa. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ndele aahiili yomepya oya kwata omupika waye, ta ye mu vege, ndele ta ye mu shunifa ko eenyala va shinya. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Okwa tumununa ko omupiya umwe. Natango oye mu vega eembole momutwe, ta ye mu sifa ohoni. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Okwa tuma ko natango omupika umwe, ndele oye mu vipaa. Mwene wepya okwa kala noku tuma ko aapiya yaye oyendji, ndele ahiili yepya oya kala noku ya vega nenge taye ya vipaa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Omunepya okwa li a saala po nomunhu umwe ike ngu ta vulu oku tuma ko, ngu oye a li omonamati omuholike, nolwahwiinina okwe mu tuma a ye ko ta ti, ‘Ondi shi shi omumwange otaye mu simaneke.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ndele aahiili yepya lyomiviinyu oya kundafana ya ti, ‘Ngu oye omufiyululi wamwene wepya. Tu mu vipayeni, opo eliko lyi ninge lyetu!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Oye mu kwata, ta ye mu vipaa, ndele taye mu ekele kondje yepya lyomandjebele.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />“Omu shii nhyi mwene wepya lyomandjebele te ya okuninga?” Yesus okwa pula.” Oshili andi mulombwele, aahiili yepya ote ya, e ya vipaye, nepya te li pe po yamwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Inamu lesha nani omishangwa vi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Emanya ndi aatungi ya ekelahi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">olyo lya ninga emanya lya simana komamanya ayehe ndi a li ningi etungo lya kola.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Nhyi Omuwa e shi ninga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">osha ninga oshikumwifa momeho yetu!” <verse eid="MRK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Aayambi aakulunhu, aalongimhango naakulunhu oya kambavala okukwata Yesus, shaanhyi oya vibulula kutya okwe ya popya meyele ndi. Ndele molwokutila molwanhyi oya li ya tila aanhu, oye mu fiya po, ndele taa yi.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Epulo kombiga yokufuta oifendela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateusa22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Lukasa20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Yamwe yomAafalisai nayamwe yomaalanduli yaHelodesa, oya tumwa opo ya kwate Yesus nomapulo meehapu vaye. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Oye ya kuye, ndele taa ti, “Mulongi, otu ku shii kutya oye omunashili, ku na sha nanhyi aanhu taa vilaavila, shaanhyi oye iho tala kondodo yomunhu, ndele oho longo aanhu ondjila yaKalunga paushili. Tu lombwela, Osha pitikwa nghaa tu yandje oifendela komupangeli Omuroma, nenge inashi pitikwa?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Yesus okwa shiwa ekotokelo lyao, ndele ta ti kuyo, “Omolwashi amu yeleke nge? Eteleinge oshimaliwa oshikukutu, ndi shi tale.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Ndele oye shi eta. Yesus okwe ya pula a ti, Efano ndi li li ko, olyalye?” Oya yamukula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">“Olyomupangeli Omuroma.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Yesus okwe ya lombwela a ti, “Nhyi shomupangeli Omuroma shi peni omupangeli Omuroma, nanhyi shaKalunga, shi peni Kalunga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Ndele oya kala ya kuminwa Yesus shili.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Epulo kombiga yeumuko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateusa22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Lukasa20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Aasadukai yamwe mba haa ti kaku na eumuko oye ya kuYesus, ndele ta ye mu pula taa ti, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Mulongi, Moses okwe tu shangela momhango kutya, ‘Nge oku na omulumenhu a sa, a fiya po omukiinhu waye, ndele ye ine mu fiila nande okaana, nena mumwaina omulumenhu na hombole po omukiinhu wamumwaina, opo a valele mumwaina okaana.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Okwa li ku na aalumenhu aamwainafana yaheyali. Ngu wosheeli okwa hombola, ndele ta si ina fiya po okaana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Omutiyali okwa hombola po omuselekavi ngo, ndele okwa sa natango ina fiya po okaana. Nomutitatu osho a ninga. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Ayehe yaheyali oya li ya hombola omukiinhu ngu ndele ayehe oya sa inaya fiya po okaana. Omukiinhu oye a huunina okusa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Hano peumuko nhyi aasi taa ka umuka, ota ka ninga omukiinhu walye mwaayehe mba, shaanhyi okwa li a hombolwa kwaayehe mba yaheyali.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti, “Nye omwa puka, shaanhyi kamu shii omishangwa neenghono va Kalunga? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Onghee hano mokuumuka kwawo kousi ihaa ka hombola yo ihaa hombolwa, otaa ka kala nganhyi aayengeli yomeulu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Ndele kombiga yeumuko, inamu lesha nani membo lyaMoses mehokololo ndi ali popi oshihwa ashi pi? MuKalunga a lombwela Moses ta ti, ‘Aame Kalunga kaAbeleham, Kalunga kaIsak naKalunga kaYakopo.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Ye ke shi Kalunga kaasi, ndee oKalunga kaanamwenyo. Nye omwa puka unene, mokwiitaela kutya Kalunga ihaka umuva aasi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oshipango oshinene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mateusa22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lukasa10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Wumwe womaalongimhango okwe ya uva nhyi ta ya kundafana. Okwa vibulula kutya Yesus okwa yamukula Aasadukai nawa. Onghee okwe ya kuYesus, ndele te mu pula ta ti, “Oshipango oshinene shi vule ikwawo ayihe shipi?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesus okwa yamukula a ti, “Oshipango oshinene shotango osho nhyi, ‘Islaeli pwaikina, Omwene Kalunga ketu, oye ike Omwene. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Hola Omwene Kalunga koye nomutima woye auhe, nomwenyo woye auhe, nomavilaavilo yoye ayehe, neenghono voye avihe.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Oshipango oshitiyali oshinene oshonhyi, ‘Hola Mukweni nganhyi wiihole mwene.’ Kaku na oshipango shi vule oipango mbi iyali.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Nena omulongimhango okwa ti ku Yesus, “Eeno Mulongi, owa popya voshili, nhyi wa ti, Omwene Kalunga oye ike Kalunga, kaku na ali Kalunga umwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Oku hola Kalunga nomutima woye auhe, nomavilaavilo yoye ayehe noneenghono avihe, nokuhola mukweni nganhyi wiihole mwene, oku vule okuyandja omafikiloyambo noiyandjwa ikwawo kuKalunga.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesus nhyi a mona kutya omulongimhango okwa yamukula nawa, okwa ti kuye, “Oye ku li kokule nOuhamba waKalunga.” Okuza mho kapwa li pu na ngu a li e na omukumo okupula Yesus sha.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Epulo kutya Kilistus olye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateusa22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Lukasa20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Nhyi Yesus a li ta longo aanhu moluumbo lyEumbo lyaKalunga, okwa pula a ti, “Aalongimhango otaa vulu ngeepi okutya Kilistus owomepata lyaDavid? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Omhepo Ondjapuki oyo ya twa David omukumo, opo a tye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Omwene okwa lombwela Omwene wange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">kala omutumba kolulyo lwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">siyo andi tula aatondi yoye kohi yeemhavi voye.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Nge David ye mwene ote mu ifana ‘Omwene’, hano Kilistus omukwapata waDavid pomukalo wupi?”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesus ta londova aanhu ya hangale aalongimhango</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateusa23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Lukasa20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Ongudu onene yaanhu oya li ya hafa okupwiikina Yesus.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesus okwa longa aanhu a ti, “Kotokeleni aalongimhango mba ye hole okweenda ya zala eenguwo noye hole okusimanekwa kaanhu pomahala mha hapu ongala aanhu, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />yo oye hole okukala omutumba koipundi yasimana mEesinagoga nopomahala ya simana moitufi. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ohaya kengelele aaselekavi, ndele taye ya kufa omaliko yawo, nohaa yalikana omaalikano omaleka yomaitalifo. Epangulo lyao ali ka kala eviyu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ongalo yomuselekavi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Lukasa21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesus okwa li omutumba a taalela koshikefa shokuumbila ongalo, ndele okwa mona, nghee aanhu taa tula mo oimaliwa moshikefa. Aayamba oyendji oya tula mo oimaliwa oyindji. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Opwe ya omuselekavi ohepele nokwa tula mo oimaliwa oikukutu iyali, mbi ya li yi na ongushu oshona lela. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yesus okwa ifana aalongwa yaye ye uye kuye, ndele ta ti kuyo, “Oshili andi mu lombwele, Omuselekavi ngu ohepele okwa tula mo oshindji moshikefa shongalo, e vule ayehe mba ya tula mo. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Shaanhyi ayehe mba, oya tula mo okashona komomauyamba yawo, ndele omuselekavi ngu moluhepo lwaye okwa tula mo ashihe nhyi a li e na, nhyi e na oku hupa musho.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta popi ehanauno lyEumbo lyaKalunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mateusa24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Lukasa21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesus nhyi a za mo mEumbo lyaKalunga, umwe womaalongwa yaye okwa ti kuye; “Mulongi, tala komamanya nomatungo nghee ya opala!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesus okwa ti kuye; “Ou wete omatungo nga omanene nga? Ihapu ka fiwa nande emanya limwe lya tenhekwa kekwawo ina li kumunwa po.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omauviyu nomahepeko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateusa24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Lukasa21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesus nhyi a li omutumba kondudu yeeholivi, a taalela kEumbo lyaKalunga, Peetulusa, Yakopo, Yohanesa naAndiliasa oye ya kuye meholamo, noye mu pula ya ti,<verse eid="MRK 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tu lombwela, onaini oinima ayihe mbi ta yi ka ningwa, neviviliko lipi a li ulike kutya ayihe oi li poku ningwa?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesus okwa tameka okuya lombwela ta ti; “Kotokeni, opo inamu pukifwa nande okomunhu. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Oshonhyi aanhu oyendji otaye ke ya, taye iyifana nevina lyange taa ti, ‘Aame Kilistus,’ ndele otaa ka pukifa oyendji. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Nge amu uvu omalwoovi neenghundana voita, inamu tila. Shaashi mbi oyi na okuningwa, ndele ehulilo inali fika natango. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Oiwana otayi ka fikama oku kondjifafana, nomauhamba otaa ka lwifa omauhamba makwao. Aku ka ningwa omakakamo yevu keembiga neembiga, nondjala ota yi ke ya. Mbi otayi ningi ongetameko lyoshifeta, okaana nge ta ka valwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Hano ikotokeleni, shaanhyi aanhu otaye ke mu yandja keemhangu, yo otaye ke mu vega neengola mEesinagoga vawo. Amu ka falwa koipala yomalenga noyeehamba, sho shi kale omhito oiwa kunye, mu ya lombwele Onghundana Oiwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Ndele tango onghundana oiwa oyi na oku uvifwa moiwana ayihe. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Nge mwa mangwa po ndele a mu yandjwa kaapanguli, inamu kala muna oshiho kutya amu ka popya shi, popyeni kehe nhyi a mu pewa pefimbo mho, shaanhyi hanye yene amu popi, ndele Omhepo Ondjapuki. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Omulumenhu otaa ka yandja mumwaina a vipawe, nomusamane ota yandja okaana. Ounona otawu kwatwa kondubo naakulunhu yawo, ndele taye ya yandja vipaa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Amu ka tondwa kwaayehe, molwevina lyange, ndele ngu te ivivimike siyo okehulilo, ota ka hupifwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oihuna yehanauno naapukifi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mateusa24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Lukasa21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Nge mwa mona oshiima oshinyanyaleki, shi li mha inashi pumbwa okukala (Omuleshi na uve ko nhyi ashi ti), Ndele mba ye li muYudea, naatembukile keendudu, <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />nangu ta hangikwa kombada yeumbo, ina ya mo meumbo a ka tale mo sha, a ye nasho. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Ngu ta hangikwa mepya, ina shuna meumbo a ka tale mo onguwo yaye. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Woo, oihuna oyi fike peni kaasimba naamwali yopomasiku yeenya! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Yalikaneni, opo inashi mu hanga pokufu. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Oshonhyi momasiku ngo, a ku ka kala ouviyu inau kala ko nande o nale, okuza ketameko nhyi Kalunga a shita ouyuni siyo opaife. No ihaku ka kala ali ouviyu wafa mha. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Mwene ngeno okwa li ina hupipika omasiku youviyu, ngeno kaku na nande omunhu ta hupu. Ndele omolwaahoololwa yaye mba a hoolola, okwa hupipika omasiku ngo.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Ndele nge oku na ngu te mu lombwele ta ti, ‘Kilistus oku li mha’, nenge ta ti, ‘Tala, oye winya’, inamu mu itaela. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Shaashi aku ke ya ookilistus aanaipupulu naahunganeki aanaipupulu, ndele taa longo omaviviliko noikumwifalonga, opo ya pukife aahoololwa yaKalunga, nge ashi vulika. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Kotokeni, onde mu lombwela ayihe nale, mhanga efimbo ina li fika.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Euyo lyOmonamati wOmunhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateusa24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Lukasa21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Ndele momasiku ngo, ouviyu mbo nge wa hula po, etango ali ka lauva, nomwevi ihau ka yela ali, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />neenyofi otavi ka wako keulu, neenghono vomewangadjo otavi ka kakamifwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Opo nee taa mono Omonamati wOmunhu, te uya moikoo, e na eenghono ovidji neyavimo. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Ye ota ka tuma aayengeli yaye, taa ka ongela aahoololwa yaye keembiga neembiga vouyuni.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elongo okuza komukwiyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateusa24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Lukasa21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Ilongeleni ko komukwiyu. Oitayi yawo shaa tayi hapa, tau tulako omafo, nena omu shi shii kutya okwenye okwa fika. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Nanye nge ta mu mono mbi nda popya petameko tayi ningwa, kaleni mu shi shii kutya, efimbo olya fika, Omonamati wOmunhu oku li popepi, pomweelo. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Oshili andi mu lombwele; “Epipi ndi iha li hulu po, mhanga ayihe mbi ina yi ningwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Eulu nevu ota li hulu po, ndele eehapu vage ihavi hulu po, ota vi kala po siyo aluhe.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaku na ngu a shiwa esiku nefimbo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mateusa24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Esiku nefimbo kaku na ngu e li shii, nhyi oinima mbi ta yi ka ningwa, naayengeli yomeulu nenge Omonamati keli shii, ndele oTate ike. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Hano kotokeni, nye mu pahuke, shaanhyi ka mu shii kutya efimbo otali fiki naini <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Ashi ka kala nganhyi omunhu ta fiye po eumbo lyaye ta yi molweendo, a fiila aapiya yaye metonatelo lyeumbo lyaye, ndele ta pe kehe umwe oshinakuwanifwa shaye, ndele ta lombwele omukeeleli woposheelo, a kale a pahuka. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Hano kaleni mwa pahuka, shaanhyi kamu shii kutya onaini mwene weumbo teya, nge ongulohi nenge omokati kousiku nenge okeengulasha nenge oshonhyi kwa sha, <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />opo nge te ya ombaavilila, ihe mu hanga mwa kofa. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Nhyi andi mu lombwele osho andi lombwele aanhu ayehe kutya, kaleni mwa pahuka!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Omhangela yokuvipaa Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateusa26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lukasa22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohanesa11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Hano nhyi kwa li ku na omasiku yaali oshitufi shOpaasa neemboloto inavi ya efulika shi fike, aayambi aakulunhu naalongimhango oya li taa kongo nghee ye na okukwata Yesus mekotokelo, yo ye mu vipaye. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ndele oya ti; “Inatu shi ninga pefimbo lyoshitufi, opo epiyaano ina li tukuluka maanhu.<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukiinhu ta simaneke Yesus noku mu tila omaavi muBetania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateusa26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohanesa12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesus nhyi a li muBetania meumbo lyaSimoni ngu a li e na oshilundu. Mhanga a li omutumba poshililo, omwe ya omukiinhu e na oshikola sha uva omaavi yondilo. Okwa suukula oshikola, ndele ta tile omaavi komutwe waYesus. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Aanhu yamwe oya li ye uvite nayi, ndele oya popyafana ya ti; “omolwashike omaavi yondilo ya hepifwa osima yongaho? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Omaavi nga ngeno oya li ya landifwapo, ngeno omwa za eeDenari, yo yi pewe eehepele.” Oya umanena omukiinhu.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Yesus okwa ti; “Mweefeni, omolwashike tamu mu piyaaneke? Okwa longela nge oshilonga oshiwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Eehepele omu li navo efimbo alihe. Efimbo kehe mwa hala amu vulu oku vi ningila ouwanawa. Ndele ame ihandi kala punye aluhe. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Omukiinhu okwa ninga nhyi ta vulu oku ninga. Okwa tetekela oku tila olutu lwange omaavi, e lu longekivile efundiko. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Oshili andi mu lombwele; “Kehe nghaa nghu onghundana oiwa ta yi ka uvifwa mouyuni auhe, oshilonga nhyi a longa otashi ka hokololwa moku mu vibuluka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudas a itaela okukengelela Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateusa26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Lukasa22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Opo nee Yudas Iskalioto umwe womaalongwa omulongo nayaali, okwa ya kaawili yaayambi, opo ya ka ninge elandulafano lyokuvipaa Yesus. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Aayambi aakulunhu nhyi ye shi uva, oya hafa, ndele ta ye mu uvanekele oku mu pa oimaliwa. Onghee hano Yudas okwa li ta kongo efimbo lya opala oku yandja Yesus moikaha yaayambi aakulunhu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta li oulalelo wOpaasa pamwe naalongwa yaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateusa26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Lukasa22:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21-23">21—23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohanesa13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Mesiku lyotango lyoshitufi sheemboloto inavi fulikwa, mu hamu vipawa ozona yOpaasa, aalongwa ya Yesus oye mu pula ya ti; “Openi wa hala, tu ke ku longikivile, opo u lye oulalelo wOpaasa?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Yesus okwa tuma yaali yomaalongwa yaye ndele ta ti kuyo; “Indeni moshilando, amu ka shakanekwa komulumenhu a hinda oshishuma shomeya. Mu landuleni <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />siyo meumbo mu ta yi, lombweleni mwene weumbo tamu ti, ‘Omulongi ota pula, onduda yaayenda oyaama peni, ndi ka lile mo oulalelo wOpaasa pamwe naalongwa yange?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Ote mu ulikile onduda onene yopombada, ya longekivwa noinima ayihe omoyili, mo omo nee amu ka longekivila ayihe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Aalongwa oya ya moshilando, naayihe oya li nganhyi Yesus e ya lombwela. Ndele oya longekiva oulalelo wOpaasa.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Nhyi kwa toka, Yesus okwe ya pamwe naalongwa yaye omulongo nayaali. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Mhanga ye li omutumba taa li oulalelo, Yesus okwa ti; “Oshili andi mu lombwele, umwe womunye ngu ta li pamwe naame, ota ka kengelelange.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Aalongwa oya li yanyika oluhovi, noya tameke oku mu pula kooumwe nooumwe taya ti; “Haame ndishi?” <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesus okwe ya yamukula a ti; “Oumwe womokati keni nye omulongo nayaali, ngu ta yelele omboloto yaye metiti pamwe naame. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Omonamati wOmunhu ota ka sa nganhyi sha shangwa momishangwa, ndele oihuna oyi fike peni komulumenhu ngu ta ka kengelela Omonamati wOmunhu! Omunhu ngo ngeno okwa li ina valwa, ngeno oshi hwepo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oulalelo wOmwene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mateusa26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Lukasa22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Aakolinto11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Mhanga ya li taa li, Yesus okwa kufa omboloto, ndele ta hambelele, ndele te yi pambula, ta pe aalongwa yaye ta ti; “Tambuleni, ndele a muli, omboloto ndji olutu lwange.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Ndele okwa kufa eholo, ndele ta pandula, ndele te ya pe noya mwa mo ayehe. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Ye okwa ti kuyo; “Ndji oyo ohonde yange, ndji ta yi kwashilipaleke ehangano lyaKalunga, ndji ta yi tilwahi omolwoyendji. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Oshili andi mu lombwele, ihandi ka mwa ali omaviinyu nga siyo esiku ndi a ndi ka mwa nga omape mOuhamba waKalunga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Oya imba eimbilo lyepandulo, ndele taa yi kondudu yeeholivi.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta popi eivibiko lyaPeetulusa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateusa26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lukasa22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohanesa13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo, “Nye amuhe amu ka matuka po, ndele amu fii nge po, oshonhyi okwa shangwa, ‘Kalunga ota vipaa po omusita, neezi avi ka halakana.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ndele nge nda yumuvwa, andi mu tetekele kuGalilea.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Peetulusa okwa ti kuye; “Ihandi ku fiye po, nande ayehe naye ku fiye po!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesus okwa ti ku Peetulusa; “Oshili, andi ku lombwele kutya ousiku mbu wonena mhanga ekondobolo inali lila lwaali, oye oto ke ivibika nge lwoikando itatu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Peetulusa okwa yamukula neenghono a ti; “Nande otashi ka pula oku sa pamwe nooye, ihandi ke ku ivibika!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Naalongwa yakwayo ayehe oya popya shafaafana.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta yalikana muGetsemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateusa26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lukasa22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Oye ya pehala evina lyalyo Getsemane, ndele Yesus okwa ti kaalongwa yaye; “Kaleni omutumba mha, mhanga andi ka yalikana.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Okwa kufa Peetulusa, Yakopo na Yohanesa, ndele okwa tameka okuuva nai unene, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />ndele okwa ti kuyo; “Omutima wange owa nyika oluhovi olunene, kaleni mha nye mu kale mwa pahuka, inamu kofa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Nhyi a ya komeho kashona, okwa twa eengolo ndele ta sizimike oshipala shaye pevu, nokwa yalikana, opo a pitililwe po kefimbo lyomahepeko nge ashi vulika. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Ye okwa ti; “Tate, Tate wange, ayihe oto yi vulu, kufa nge eholo ndi lyokuhepekwa, hanganhyi Ame nda hala, ndele onganhyi wa hala.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ndele Yesus okwa yalukila kaalongwa mba yatatu, ndele okwa hanga ya kofa, ndele ta ti ku Peetulusa; “Simoni! Owa kofa? Ino vula nande oku pahuka nande owili yimwe?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Okwa ti kuyo; “Pahukeni, nye mu yalikane, opo ina mu wila momashongo. Omhepo oya hala, ndele ombelela onghundi.<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Okwa za po natango, ndele ta ka yalikana ta popi eehapu va faafana. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Nhyi a yalukila kaalongwa, okwe ya hanga ya kofa, inaa vula okukaleka omeho yawo ya pahuka. Ndele yo kaya li ye shii nhyi ye na oku mu yamukula.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Nhyi a yaluka olutitatu okwa ti kuyo; “Natango otamu kofa ike nye tamu fuvapo? Osha wana nee. Efimbo olya fika. Tala, Omonamati wOmunhu ota yandjwa momake yaalunde. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Fikameni, tu yeni. Tala, ngu ta kengele nge oku li popepi!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta kwatwa po</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateusa26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lukasa22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohanesa18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Mhanga Yesus ta popi, Yudas umwe womumba omulongo nayaali okwe ya nongudu onene yaanhu ya tya omaongamwele neendibo, ya tumwa kaawiliki yaayambi, kaalongimhango nokaakulunhu. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Omukengeleli, okwa pa mba ali nayo oshivibulukifo ta ti; “Ngu andi ka kunda ne hupito komhanda, oye mwahala. Mu kwateni po, nye mu ye naye mwe mu viinina.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yudas nhyi a fika, okwa endelela okuya kuYesus ndele ta ti; “Mulongi!” Ndele okwe mu kunda ne hupito komhanda. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Opo nee oye mu kwata po, ndele ta ye mu manga ya viinina. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Ndele umwe womumba ya li pamwe naYesus, okwa kufa mo eongamwele, ndele ta ponokele omupiya womukulunhu waayambi, temu tete okutwi. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesus okwa ti kuyo; “Omwe ya okukwata nge po mu na omaongamwele neendibo ndafa omukolokohi? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Kehe esiku onda kala nanye mEumbo lyaKalunga andi longo aanhu, ndele ina mu kwata nge po. Ndele nhyi oshi na okuningwa, opo omishangwa vi wanifwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Opo nee aalongwa ayehe oye mu fiyi po, ndele taa matuka po.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Opwa li omumati umwe omunyasha, a zala elapi etokele, a landula Yesus. Oya kambavala oku mu kwata. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Ndele okwa fiya po elapi lyaye nokwa matuka po e li olutu kondje.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta pangulwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mateusa26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Lukasa22:54-55</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohanesa18:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:24">19:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Oya fala Yesus keumbo lyomuyambi omukulunhu, nghu kwa ongala aawiliki yaayambi ayehe, naalongimhango naakulunhu. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Peetulusa okwa landula Yesus e li konima kokule, siyo omoluumbo lweumbo lyomuyambi omukulunhu. Okwa ka kala omutumba pomundilo, ta huhulukwa pamwe naatonateli. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Ndele aawiliki yaayambi, aakulunhu noshoongi ashihe shaatokoli, oya li taa kongo aanhu ya yandje oumbagi wooli, ya lundile Yesus, opo ye mu vipaye, ndele inaye wu mona. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Oyendji oye mu lundila, ndele omalundilo yawo inaa twa kumwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Opo nee aalumenhu yamwe oya fikama, ye mu lundila ya ti, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Se otwe mu uva ta ti, ‘Andi kumuna po Eumbo lyaKalunga ndi lya tungwa komunhu, ndele momasiku yatatu andi tungu yimwe, ndji inayi tungwa komunhu.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Nande ongaanhyo, omapopyo yawo inaya twa kumwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Omuyambi omukulunhu okwa fikama komeho yawo ndele ta pula Yesus a ti; “Ku na eyamukulo komapopyo nga to popilwa?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ndele Yesus okwa mwena, ina ya mukula sha. Omuyambi omukulunhu okwe mu pula a ti; “Ooye Kilistus, Omonamati waKalunga omuyambekwa?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesus okwa yamukula; “Eeno, Aame. No, amu ka mona Omonamati wOmunhu e li omutumba kolulyo lwaKalunga ngu e na eenghono, no amu ke mu mona nhyi ta ka aluka ta ende moikoo yokeulu!”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Omuyambi omukulunhu okwa taula oikutu yaye, ndele ta ti; “Inatu pumbwa ali eembagi! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Etukano lyaye omwe li uva. Etokolo lyeni lipi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Ndele ayehe oya kala ye li omhinge naYesus, ndele ayehe oye mu mona ondjo, noya ti na vipawe.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Opo nee yamwe yomuyo oya tameka okusiila Yesus omate, nokumu siikila koshipala, ndele taye mu vege neengonyo, ndele taa ti kuye; “Hunganeka ngu eku vega!” Aatonateli oye mu kufa, ndele ta ye mu vege nomanghaa.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetulusa te ivibike Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mateusa26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lukasa22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohanesa18:15-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Ndele mhanga natango Peetulusa nhyi e li moluumbo lwomeni, opwe ya umwe womaayakuli aakavona yomuyambi omukulunhu. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Ndele nhyi a mona Peetulusa ta huhulukwa, okwe mu tala ndele ta ti; “Nooye owa li pamwe na Yesus Omunasareta.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Ndele Peetulusa okwe ivibika, ndele ta ti; “Kandi mu shii nokandi uvite nhyi wa hala okutya.” Okwa za po a uka lwoposheelo shopondje nekondobolo olya lila.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Natango omuyakuli omukavona okwe mu mona, ndele ta lombwele aanhu mba ya li ya fikama mho ta ti, ‘Omulumenhu ngu naye umwe womuyo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Peetulusa okwe ivibika natango.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Konima yokafimbo aanhu mba ya li po ya fikama, oya lombwela Peetulusa ya ti; “Oshili, ooye umwe womuyeenya, shaanhyi nooye Omugalilea.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Peetulusa okwa ana ta ti; “Andi mu lombwele oshili! Kalunga na handukilenge nge ihandi popi oshili! “Omulumenhu ngu amu popi, kandi mu shi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Efimbo ndjo, ekondobolo olya lila olutiyali. Peetulusa okwa vibulula eehapu vi Yesus e mu lombwela, nhyi a tile; “Ekondobolo mhanga inali lila lwaali, oto ivibike nge lutatu.” Peetulusa okwa uvu nayi unene, ndele ta lili neenghono.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesus koshipala shaPilatus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateusa27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">11:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Lukasa23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohanesa18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Ongula onene, aawiliki yaayambi oya ongala meendelelo naakulunhu, naalongimhango, noilyo ayihe yaapanguli noya ninga eemhangela vawo. Oya manga Yesus nomalyenge, ndele ta ye mu yandja kuPilatus. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilatus okwe mu pula a ti, “Ooye Ohamba yAajewish?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yesus okwe mu yamukula, “Ngahnyi to ti.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Aawiliki yaayambi oya li taye mu lundile moinima oyindji. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Natango Pilatus okwe mu pula ta ti, “Iho yamukula sha? Pwaikina komalundilo ayehe nga topopilwa!”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ndele Yesus ina yamukula sha, onghee Pilatus okwa li a kumwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta tokolelwa eso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateusa27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lukasa23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohanesa18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Poshitufi shOpaasa kehe, Pilatus okwa li e na omukalo, ha mangulula omunavologo umwe, kehe ngu aanhu ya pula. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Pefimbo mho opwa li pu na omulumenhu umwe wevina Barabbas ngu a li movologo naakolokohi ooyakwawo mba ya li ya lwa nepangelo, nomokukolokoha kwawo oya li ya vipaa aanhu. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Ongudu yaanhu oye ya, ndele taa tameke okupula Pilatus e ya ningile, nganhyi ha ningi shito. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilatus okwe ya pula a ti, “Omwa hala ndi mu mangululile ohamba yaaJewish?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Shaashi okwa li e shi shii kutya aawiliki yaayambi oye mu etela Yesus omolwa ondubo.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ndele aawiliki yaayambi oya lombwela aanhu ya indile Pilatus e ya mangululile Barabbas. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilatus natango okwa ti, “Omulumenhu ngu amu ti oye ohamba yaaJewish omwa hala ndi mu ninge ngeepi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Oya ingiva ya ti, “Mu yaalela komushiyakano!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilatus okwe ya pula, “Hano okwa ninga ouyi washike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Ndele oya ingiva mopale ya ti, “Mu yaalela komushiyakano!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Ndele molwanhyi Pilatus okwa li a hala okwoopalela aanhu, okwe ya mangululila Barabbas. Okwa vegifa Yesus, ndele te mu yandja, a ka yaalelwe komushiyakano.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta shekwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mateusa27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohanesa19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Aakwaita oya fala Yesus meni yoluumbo lweumbo lwombala, ndele taa ifana etanga lyao alihe lyaakwaita. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Ndele oye mu zaleka onguwo yolwaala lwafa oshiyokahi, oya tunga oshishani shomakwiya, ndele taye shi mu zaleke komutwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Oya tameka oku mu kunda taa ti, “Kala nomwenyo omuleka ohamba yaaJewish!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Oye mu vega noshihati komutwe, ndele ta ye mu siile omate, ndele ta ye mu twile eengolo ya fa ngeno ta ye mu inyongamene shili. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Nhyi ya mana oku mu sheka, oye mu vula onguwo ndjo yolwaala lwafa oshiyokahi, ndele ta ye mu zaleke onguwo yaye mwene. Oye mu kufa, ye ke mu yalela komushiyakano.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta alelwa komushiyakano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateusa27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lukasa23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohanesa19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Mondjila yawo oya shakena naSimoni, omulumenhu Omukireni a li ta zi kepya a uka koshilando. Oye he ya Aleksandel naRufus. Aakwaita oye mu kondjifa a hinde ko komushaakano waYesus. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Oya eta Yesus kehala a li ifanwa Golgota, nhyi ashi ti, Ehala Lyomakolotwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Oye mu pa omaviinyu ya tulwa mumwe nomuti hawu ifanwa Omira, ndele Yesus ine ya mwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Nhyi ye mu yalela komushiyakano, oya topolelafana oikutu yaye moku ninga oshihoololifo, kutya otayi ningi yalye nalye. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Efimbo ndi ye mu yalela komushiyakano, oya li omungoyi wongula. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Komushiyakano oya li ya shanga ko enyolo lyanhyi shemu yaalelifa komushiyakano a li ti, “ohamba yaaJewish.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Pamwe naye opwa li pwa yalelwa aakolokohi yaali, umwe okolulyo namukwawo okolumoho. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Oshonhyi enyolo olya wanifwa ndi ali ti, ‘Okwa yalulilwa maakolokohi.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Aanhu mba ya li taya ende po oya li taya umbu omihe nokupukaapuka komitwe ya ti, “Hamba ooye, ngu to kumunapo Eumbo lyaKalunga, ndele to li tungulula momasiku yatatu, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />ihupifa ooye mwene, oye wiikufe ko komushiyakano.<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Momukalo wa faafana aawiliki yaayambi naalongimhango oye mu sheka ya ti, “Okwa li ha hupifa aanhu yamwe, ndele paife okwa nyengwa okwii hupifa ye mwene! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Kilistus ohamba yaIslaeli, za ko komushiyakano ngho paife opo tu shi mone, se tu itaele!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Namba ya li ya yaalelwa pamwe naYesus, oye mu sheka.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eso lyaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateusa27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lukasa23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohanesa19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Mokati komutenya oshilongo ashihe osha siikilwa komilaulu siyo opo nhatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Powili onhinhatu Yesus okwa ingiva mopale a ti, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabaktani?” Nhyi ashi ti, “Kalunga kange, Kalunga kange, oshishi wa ekela nge hi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Yamwe yomumba ya li ya fikama mho nhyi ye shi uva, oya ti, “Pwaikineni, ota ifana Elia!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Wumwe womuyo okwa matuka, ndele ta kufa elapi, ndele te li yaeke omaviinyu omalulu, okwe li tula koshihati, ndele te mu mwefa ta ti, “Teeleleni tu tale nge Elia ote ya oku mu kufa ko komushiyakano!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yesus okwa lila mopale, ndele ta si,<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />nelapi ndi lya li lya topola ko ehala ndi eyapukilela Meumbo lyaKalunga olya tauka pokati moipambu iyali okuza pombada siyo opohi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Omukulunhu waakwaita ngu a li a fikama komeho yomushiyakano, nhyi a mona nghee Yesus a sa, okwa ti, “Oshili, omulumenhu ngu okwa li Omonamati waKalunga!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Okwa li kuna aakiinhu ya fikama kokule taa tala. Mokati kawo omwa li muna Malia Mahatalena, Salome naMalia yina yaYosef naYakopo womushona. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Aakiinhu mba oya kala ya landula Yesus, nhyi a li mu Galilea no ya kala ta ye mu yakula. Aakiinhu oyendji mba ya li ye ya ku Yelusalema naYesus nayo opo yali.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta fundikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateusa27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lukasa23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohanesa19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Esiku Yesus a yalelwa komushiyakano olya li etitano, esiku ndi Aayuda ye na okwiilongekivila esiku lyEsabati. Nhyi kwali ku li poku toka, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosef Omurimatia oshilyo sha simana shaapanguli, ngu a li a teelela Ouhamba waKalunga okwa ya kuPilatus nokwe mu indile e mu pe olutu lwaYesus. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilatus okwa li a kumwa, nhyi a uva kutya Yesus okwa sa. Okwa ifana omukulunhu waakwaita e mu pule nge Yesus okwa sa nale. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Nhyi a uva komukulunhu waakwaita kutya okwa sa shili, okwa pitike Yosef a ka kufe ko olutu lwaYesus. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosef okwa landa elapi etokele. Okwa kufa ko olutu lwaYesus komushiyakano ndele te lu vigile melapi ndyo, ndele te lu nangeke mombila ndji ya li ya panda memanya, ndele ta alangatifile po emanya posheelo shombila. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Malia magdalena naMalia yina yaYosef, oya li taa tala noya mona mha olutu lwaYesus lwa tulwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Eumuko lyaYesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mateusa28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lukasa24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohanesa20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Esiku lyEsabati nhyi lya pita, Malia Mahatalena, Salome naMalia yina yaJokob oya landa oiziba ya nyika nawa, ya ka yaeke olutu lwaYesus. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Ongula onene yosoondaha, etango nhyi a li piti oya ya kombila. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Mhanga ye li mondjila, oye ipula ya ti, “Olye teke tu kufila po emanya posheelo shombila? <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Nhyi ya tala kombila, oya mona kutya emanya olya kufwa po nale, nande olya li enene neenghono. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Nhyi ya ya meni lyombila, oya mona mo omulumenhu omunyasha, e li omutumba kolulyo, a zala onguwo ondeka onhokele, noya li ya tila.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Omulumenhu okwa ti kuyo, “Inamu tila. Ondishi shii kutya amu kongo Yesus Omunasareta, ngu a li a yaalelwa komushiyakano. Okwa umuka, keli mo mu. Tala pehala mha, opo ya li ye mu tula. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Indeni mu ka lombwele aalongwa ya ye mwakwatelwa na Peetulusa kutya Yesus ote ke mu tetekele ku Galilea, nghu amu ke mu mona nganhyi e mu lombwela.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Oya za mo mombila taa matuka yangwagwana yo taa kakama. Inaa popya sha nande okomunhu, shaanhyi oya li ya tila.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus te ihololele Malia Mahatalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mateusa28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yohanesa20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Ongula onene yOsoondaha Yesus nhyi a umuka, okwe yi hololela tango Malia Mahatalena, ngu muye Yesus a li a tamo eemhepo va kaka heyali. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Malia okwa ya nokwa hokololela ayehe mba ya li haa kala naYesus mba ya li ya nyika oluhovi yo taa lili. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ndele nhyi ya uva kutya Yesus oku na omwenyo nokwe mu mona,ina ye mu itaela.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus te ihololele aalongwa yaali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Lukasa24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Konima yanhyi, Yesus okwe iholola molupe lwa yooloka kaalongwa yaye yaali mhanga ya li ya uka komikunda. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Oya shuna ndele taa ka lombwela yakwawo, ndele nayo ina ye shi itaela.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus te ihololele aalongwa omulongo naumwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateusa28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lukasa24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohanesa20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Oilonga1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Lwahwiinina, Yesus okwe ihololela aalongwa omulongo naumwe, mhanga ya li taa li. Okwe ya umanena molwokuhaitayela kwawo nomolwoukukutu womitima vawo nanhyi inaa itaela mba ye mu mona nhyi a umuka. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Okwa ti kuyo, “Indeni nouyuni auhe, ka uvifileni aashitwa ayehe Onghundana Oiwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Ngu ta itaele ndele ta shashwa ota ka hupifwa, ndele ngu ina itaela, ota ka pangulwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Mba ya itaela otaa ka pewa eenghono vokulonga oikumwifalonga. Mevina lyange otaa ka ta mo eemhepo va kaka, yo otaa ka popya omalaka omape, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Otaa ka kwata omayoka neenyala, taa ka mwa ouziyo ndele ihawu keya ningi sha. Otaa ka tenheka omake kaanauvu ndele aanauvu otaa ka yeluka.<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus ta falwa meulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Lukasa24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Oilonga1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Konima Omwene Yesus nhyi a popya naalongwa yaye, okwa kufwa po ndele ta yi meulu, ndele ta kala omutumba kolulyo lwaKalunga. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Aalongwa oya ya, ndele taa uvifile aanhu ayehe. Omwene okwa longa pamwe nayo nokwa koleke kutya omauvifo yawo oyo shili noikumwifalonga mbi ya longwa.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>